(641907, 67049, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really stunning!</td>', 'Really stunning!', '2004-03-29 01:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(641910, 67063, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the colors are great together, the blue background was a perfect choice.</td>', 'Great shot, the colors are great together, the blue background was a perfect choice.', '2004-03-29 01:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(641912, 66934, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting theme.. this could go two ways.  I could be blurry because I haven''t had coffee... I could be blurry because I have had too much :)  Your title leads me to the former... Hmmm.. I could be blurry because I have had too much alcohol and the coffee is going to sober me up... it makes me think, none-the-less... nice work :) = 8</td>', 'Interesting theme.. this could go two ways.  I could be blurry because I haven''t had coffee... I could be blurry because I have had too much :)  Your title leads me to the former... Hmmm.. I could be blurry because I have had too much alcohol and the coffee is going to sober me up... it makes me think, none-the-less... nice work :) = 8', '2004-03-29 01:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(641913, 66824, 15207, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2004-03-29 01:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(641914, 67074, 15207, '<td valign="top">Wow! Really excellent shot. This is very eye catching. Love the composition.</td>', 'Wow! Really excellent shot. This is very eye catching. Love the composition.', '2004-03-29 01:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(641915, 67142, 15207, '<td valign="top">This one really stands out - very original. GOod luck!</td>', 'This one really stands out - very original. GOod luck!', '2004-03-29 01:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(641917, 66799, 772, '<td valign="top">The theme here is interesting... I''m not sure if the exposure is a good one though.  You have created the motion but the ''tension'' created by the overexposure on this photo may be a bit harsh... = 6</td>', 'The theme here is interesting... I''m not sure if the exposure is a good one though.  You have created the motion but the ''tension'' created by the overexposure on this photo may be a bit harsh... = 6', '2004-03-29 01:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(641918, 67179, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice execution...  This is a fun project photo for sure :) = 6</td>', 'Nice execution...  This is a fun project photo for sure :) = 6', '2004-03-29 01:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(641919, 66795, 15207, '<td valign="top">LOVE this angle. I think you''re going to do really well with this one. Love the blurred road!</td>', 'LOVE this angle. I think you''re going to do really well with this one. Love the blurred road!', '2004-03-29 01:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(641921, 67003, 14952, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, although the background is somewhat lacking with the barrels.<br/> <br/>I know how difficult this can be, and this is a very nice photo.</td>', 'Nice photo, although the background is somewhat lacking with the barrels. I know how difficult this can be, and this is a very nice photo.', '2004-03-29 01:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(641922, 67080, 772, '<td valign="top">Windmills are good subjects for motion blur... I think this particular photo would benefit from a tighter composition because the empty space is not adding anything to the image. = 5</td>', 'Windmills are good subjects for motion blur... I think this particular photo would benefit from a tighter composition because the empty space is not adding anything to the image. = 5', '2004-03-29 01:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(641923, 67031, 15207, '<td valign="top">Very crisp. Love the happy emotion conveyed, angle and the composition.</td>', 'Very crisp. Love the happy emotion conveyed, angle and the composition.', '2004-03-29 01:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(641924, 67003, 15207, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2004-03-29 01:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(641926, 66923, 772, '<td valign="top">VerTigo is definitely a sense that zoom bursts can create.  I think you did a decent job with this technique.  It''s not easy.  I tried it for the first time myself this week... = 6</td>', 'VerTigo is definitely a sense that zoom bursts can create.  I think you did a decent job with this technique.  It''s not easy.  I tried it for the first time myself this week... = 6', '2004-03-29 01:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(641927, 66676, 15207, '<td valign="top">lOVE IT!</td>', 'lOVE IT!', '2004-03-29 01:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(641928, 67117, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful colours and effect!</td>', 'Really beautiful colours and effect!', '2004-03-29 01:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(641929, 67074, 14952, '<td valign="top">T</td>', 'T', '2004-03-29 01:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(641930, 67176, 772, '<td valign="top">Very interesting technique :)  I like the theory behind this shot quite a bit.  The combination of stopped motion inside the car and the blur outside is intriguing.  You get extra points for a creative exposure with the flash :) = 8</td>', 'Very interesting technique :)  I like the theory behind this shot quite a bit.  The combination of stopped motion inside the car and the blur outside is intriguing.  You get extra points for a creative exposure with the flash :) = 8', '2004-03-29 01:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
