(641935, 67133, 14952, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I love it.  The background towards the top is a bit distracting though.</td>', 'Great shot, I love it.  The background towards the top is a bit distracting though.', '2004-03-29 01:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
