(641941, 66983, 772, '<td valign="top">I think the high key nature of this long exposure works rather well.  The small amount of visible surface underneath the rear duck creates just enough base to understand the image... = 7</td>', 'I think the high key nature of this long exposure works rather well.  The small amount of visible surface underneath the rear duck creates just enough base to understand the image... = 7', '2004-03-29 01:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
