(641945, 66690, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really cool. Love that the curves move the eye - and the motion is concurrent with the movement. Great capture!</td>', 'Really cool. Love that the curves move the eye - and the motion is concurrent with the movement. Great capture!', '2004-03-29 01:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(641946, 67051, 15207, '<td valign="top">Glad someone chose some humour. Love this shot!</td>', 'Glad someone chose some humour. Love this shot!', '2004-03-29 01:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(641947, 67170, 14952, '<td valign="top">Almost an incredible shot.  It seems slightly out of focus to me.  It was a difficult shot to get a good exposure on because of the harsh lighting, but the whites are too blown out for my tastes.</td>', 'Almost an incredible shot.  It seems slightly out of focus to me.  It was a difficult shot to get a good exposure on because of the harsh lighting, but the whites are too blown out for my tastes.', '2004-03-29 01:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(641948, 67123, 772, '<td valign="top">The wolf is a gorgeous creature :)  The composition here is a bit awkward for me.  My personal taste would prefer a wider view which would give the wolf more room for ''movement''.  You may suffer some loss for lack of blur, even though there is some visible... = 5</td>', 'The wolf is a gorgeous creature :)  The composition here is a bit awkward for me.  My personal taste would prefer a wider view which would give the wolf more room for ''movement''.  You may suffer some loss for lack of blur, even though there is some visible... = 5', '2004-03-29 01:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(641950, 67017, 327, '<td valign="top">Really a good capture of motion. I like this and think it''s on target for the challenge. I would only question why such a tight crop? Congrats to  you, hope this will do well. 9 from me.</td>', 'Really a good capture of motion. I like this and think it''s on target for the challenge. I would only question why such a tight crop? Congrats to  you, hope this will do well. 9 from me.', '2004-03-29 01:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(641952, 67112, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is an EXCELLENT shot. I think you could have taken home a ribbon for this one. However, DPCers tend to vote low on small images. Would have done extremely well if the pixel size was increased. Really great action shot. Good luck. I''m giving it the highest score so far.</td>', 'This is an EXCELLENT shot. I think you could have taken home a ribbon for this one. However, DPCers tend to vote low on small images. Would have done extremely well if the pixel size was increased. Really great action shot. Good luck. I''m giving it the highest score so far.', '2004-03-29 01:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(641953, 66053, 14952, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t show any motion blur to me.  It just looks out of focus.</td>', 'This doesn''t show any motion blur to me.  It just looks out of focus.', '2004-03-29 01:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(641956, 67039, 15207, '<td valign="top">Just how I feel every day! Great shot&gt; I hope you do really well!!! Love the overall effect. Good luck!</td>', 'Just how I feel every day! Great shot> I hope you do really well!!! Love the overall effect. Good luck!', '2004-03-29 01:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(641958, 66927, 10167, '<td valign="top">Texas, ehh?  :)  Nice shot.</td>', 'Texas, ehh?  :)  Nice shot.', '2004-03-29 01:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(641960, 66870, 15207, '<td valign="top">Glad someone chose some humour. I love it!!</td>', 'Glad someone chose some humour. I love it!!', '2004-03-29 01:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(641961, 67039, 14952, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot.  A few suggestions... It seems a bit noisy to me, perhaps take it through neatimage once and see what that does for it.  Also, the expression doesn''t quite seem to be what you are trying to get across.  I think confused would have made a better title for this one.</td>', 'I like it a lot.  A few suggestions... It seems a bit noisy to me, perhaps take it through neatimage once and see what that does for it.  Also, the expression doesn''t quite seem to be what you are trying to get across.  I think confused would have made a better title for this one.', '2004-03-29 01:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(641962, 67169, 327, '<td valign="top">Not sure the black frame was the best idea for this shot. Seems to interrupt the flow. I do like this and the color is great.</td>', 'Not sure the black frame was the best idea for this shot. Seems to interrupt the flow. I do like this and the color is great.', '2004-03-29 01:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(641963, 67064, 15207, '<td valign="top">My absolute favorite so far. Just amazing colours, action, everything. I predict a ribbon!</td>', 'My absolute favorite so far. Just amazing colours, action, everything. I predict a ribbon!', '2004-03-29 01:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
