(641991, 67124, 17837, '<td valign="top">Neat Idea</td>', 'Neat Idea', '2004-03-29 01:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(641992, 67136, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the theme of this shot but the composition is too tight for my taste.  Personally, I would have done one of two things here... I would have either backed out some to include the flag in its entirety or I would have gone in closer to include just a portion of the flag.  This compositoin feels cramped and either of these adjustments could possible improve that... = 4</td>', 'I like the theme of this shot but the composition is too tight for my taste.  Personally, I would have done one of two things here... I would have either backed out some to include the flag in its entirety or I would have gone in closer to include just a portion of the flag.  This compositoin feels cramped and either of these adjustments could possible improve that... = 4', '2004-03-29 01:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(641997, 66795, 772, '<td valign="top">I like this motion blur quite a bit.  I hate the title.  The (no edit) part just doesn''t fit.  Some people say titles don''t matter, but I disagree wholeheartedly.  It''s part of what you present so it''s part of the overall image.  This would have been a 8 but the title choice brings it to a 6...</td>', 'I like this motion blur quite a bit.  I hate the title.  The (no edit) part just doesn''t fit.  Some people say titles don''t matter, but I disagree wholeheartedly.  It''s part of what you present so it''s part of the overall image.  This would have been a 8 but the title choice brings it to a 6...', '2004-03-29 01:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(641998, 67051, 17837, '<td valign="top">his eye is veyr trippy! lol great pic though</td>', 'his eye is veyr trippy! lol great pic though', '2004-03-29 01:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
