(642005, 66489, 772, '<td valign="top">The composition of this shot is ok, but there are two elements that I don''t like about it.  1 - There is actually a bit too much blur in this one.  I think that slightly less blur would help create some more definition in the moving subject.  2 - having the head clipped off in the top of the frame is a bit odd feeling... = 5</td>', 'The composition of this shot is ok, but there are two elements that I don''t like about it.  1 - There is actually a bit too much blur in this one.  I think that slightly less blur would help create some more definition in the moving subject.  2 - having the head clipped off in the top of the frame is a bit odd feeling... = 5', '2004-03-29 01:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
