(642074, 67024, 51167, '<td valign="top">Water is my favorite subject to photograph.  Your composition and the lighting on the rocks are wonderful.  My only suggestion would be to expose just a little longer.  I don''t know how long your exposure was for, but I have found in a shot like this that water look best at about 2 or more seconds.  Also, I love the reflections that are in the water in the upper right-hand corner of the photo.  Did you get any other closer shots and different angles? 6</td>', 'Water is my favorite subject to photograph.  Your composition and the lighting on the rocks are wonderful.  My only suggestion would be to expose just a little longer.  I don''t know how long your exposure was for, but I have found in a shot like this that water look best at about 2 or more seconds.  Also, I love the reflections that are in the water in the upper right-hand corner of the photo.  Did you get any other closer shots and different angles? 6', '2004-03-29 02:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(642079, 67034, 15511, '<td valign="top">Obviously. Therefore, clarification in title seems contrived...<br/>Nice shot!</td>', 'Obviously. Therefore, clarification in title seems contrived...Nice shot!', '2004-03-29 02:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(642083, 67119, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2004-03-29 02:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(642085, 67138, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very good.</td>', 'Very good.', '2004-03-29 02:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(642086, 67133, 6130, '<td valign="top">Great 10</td>', 'Great 10', '2004-03-29 02:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(642087, 66827, 15511, '<td valign="top">It''s not clear what I''m looking at, hence the motion is not understood.</td>', 'It''s not clear what I''m looking at, hence the motion is not understood.', '2004-03-29 02:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
