(642098, 66988, 15407, '<td valign="top">If that isn''t a PS shot &amp; you ''cptured it'' youdeserve to win !  I had a gokart coming at me at 80 MPH plus and did what I could.</td>', 'If that isn''t a PS shot & you ''cptured it'' youdeserve to win !  I had a gokart coming at me at 80 MPH plus and did what I could.', '2004-03-29 02:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
