(642106, 67128, 15407, '<td valign="top">WOW  the wild blue wonder - well done!</td>', 'WOW  the wild blue wonder - well done!', '2004-03-29 03:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(642107, 67119, 15511, '<td valign="top">The "zoom" blur is not necessary to convey the motion. Otherwise, good capture.</td>', 'The "zoom" blur is not necessary to convey the motion. Otherwise, good capture.', '2004-03-29 03:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(642109, 66923, 15511, '<td valign="top">Uh, candles in motion?</td>', 'Uh, candles in motion?', '2004-03-29 03:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(642110, 67134, 8522, '<td valign="top">The motion-blur car in this shot doesn''t immediately draw the eye... I''d have liked to see it have a more prominent place in your composition. The starburst lights are effective. The combination of natural light and artificial light is difficult to expose for, and I think your white balance is slightly off here... I''d have played around with different colour adjustments in Photoshop for the shadows and highlights. Perhaps more warmth in the shadows, and make the highlights cooler. Composition doesn''t do much for me.</td>', 'The motion-blur car in this shot doesn''t immediately draw the eye... I''d have liked to see it have a more prominent place in your composition. The starburst lights are effective. The combination of natural light and artificial light is difficult to expose for, and I think your white balance is slightly off here... I''d have played around with different colour adjustments in Photoshop for the shadows and highlights. Perhaps more warmth in the shadows, and make the highlights cooler. Composition doesn''t do much for me.', '2004-03-29 03:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(642111, 67179, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great idea, shame the flash doesn''t flatter the Coke can too well. The colours are a bit dull, and the flash has bounced off the can. The image is a bit noisy... did you try NeatImage? I''d have been tempted to centre the motion trail in the frame rather than the can. At the moment, it looks off-centre to me. Well done getting a uniformly black background.</td>', 'Great idea, shame the flash doesn''t flatter the Coke can too well. The colours are a bit dull, and the flash has bounced off the can. The image is a bit noisy... did you try NeatImage? I''d have been tempted to centre the motion trail in the frame rather than the can. At the moment, it looks off-centre to me. Well done getting a uniformly black background.', '2004-03-29 03:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(642113, 67063, 8522, '<td valign="top">Delicious juxtaposition of colours. Great motion blur. Effective subject. I like this very much. Your crop doesn''t quite do this justice though. I don''t often say this, but I think this would benefit from a good border.</td>', 'Delicious juxtaposition of colours. Great motion blur. Effective subject. I like this very much. Your crop doesn''t quite do this justice though. I don''t often say this, but I think this would benefit from a good border.', '2004-03-29 03:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(642115, 67138, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a good picture! I love the way you can see the motion blur in the water as well.</td>', 'What a good picture! I love the way you can see the motion blur in the water as well.', '2004-03-29 03:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(642116, 67074, 8522, '<td valign="top">Motion blur doesn''t work for me at all here, as it is curved. Also, the wheels on the car are not blurred, so I don''t the impression of any speed at all. I don''t like the crop... the wheels look unintentionally chopped off. The car doesn''t seem very sharp. Sorry to be so down on you, as it was a great idea, and I really like the graduated green.</td>', 'Motion blur doesn''t work for me at all here, as it is curved. Also, the wheels on the car are not blurred, so I don''t the impression of any speed at all. I don''t like the crop... the wheels look unintentionally chopped off. The car doesn''t seem very sharp. Sorry to be so down on you, as it was a great idea, and I really like the graduated green.', '2004-03-29 03:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(642117, 66914, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but I don''t see any motion blur. 1</td>', 'Great shot, but I don''t see any motion blur. 1', '2004-03-29 03:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(642118, 67108, 8522, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot, but the composition doesn''t make this high-impact for me. The main point of focus here is the text, which I lose interest in after a short while.</td>', 'An interesting shot, but the composition doesn''t make this high-impact for me. The main point of focus here is the text, which I lose interest in after a short while.', '2004-03-29 03:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(642119, 67156, 8522, '<td valign="top">I love this shot! Very imaginative and creative. The saturation on the flowers seems very dull though, and lets this down from being a potential number 1 IMO.</td>', 'I love this shot! Very imaginative and creative. The saturation on the flowers seems very dull though, and lets this down from being a potential number 1 IMO.', '2004-03-29 03:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(642125, 67174, 8522, '<td valign="top">Apart from the fact this is out of focus, I don''t see any motion blur. 1</td>', 'Apart from the fact this is out of focus, I don''t see any motion blur. 1', '2004-03-29 03:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(642127, 67123, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting application of motion blur. Great subject, it''s a shame he doesn''t stand out against the background too well. His rear legs look a little awkward in this shot. I''d have liked a lot of negative space for him to walk into. The main focus here should be his eyes, and they are too much to the side of the frame for this to feel comfortable.</td>', 'Interesting application of motion blur. Great subject, it''s a shame he doesn''t stand out against the background too well. His rear legs look a little awkward in this shot. I''d have liked a lot of negative space for him to walk into. The main focus here should be his eyes, and they are too much to the side of the frame for this to feel comfortable.', '2004-03-29 03:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(642128, 67007, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I tried to do this with my camera (and couldn''t) so I know it''s not easy!</td>', 'Very nice shot. I tried to do this with my camera (and couldn''t) so I know it''s not easy!', '2004-03-29 03:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(642129, 67143, 8522, '<td valign="top">Good panning technique, nice and sharp. The composition doesn''t do much for me though, I think more negative space is needed... maybe for the boat to enter into. The colours seem a little flat.</td>', 'Good panning technique, nice and sharp. The composition doesn''t do much for me though, I think more negative space is needed... maybe for the boat to enter into. The colours seem a little flat.', '2004-03-29 03:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(642130, 66951, 8522, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea, great expression. I think the shot could have been made more dramatic in several ways: Maybe a longer shutter speed would have helped, but my choice of shot would have been a long shutter speed to show the motion trail of the sponge including the moment where it hits his face which could have been caught with a flash.</td>', 'An interesting idea, great expression. I think the shot could have been made more dramatic in several ways: Maybe a longer shutter speed would have helped, but my choice of shot would have been a long shutter speed to show the motion trail of the sponge including the moment where it hits his face which could have been caught with a flash.', '2004-03-29 03:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(642131, 67062, 8522, '<td valign="top">Fantastic composition... I don''t know if it was intentional, but I like the burnt out highlights which contrast nicely with the subject''s face. I''d have liked the background much more sharp though. This is just blurry enough to look unintentional. I like the fact that the subject is almost out of the frame. The sloping horizon works well.</td>', 'Fantastic composition... I don''t know if it was intentional, but I like the burnt out highlights which contrast nicely with the subject''s face. I''d have liked the background much more sharp though. This is just blurry enough to look unintentional. I like the fact that the subject is almost out of the frame. The sloping horizon works well.', '2004-03-29 03:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(642132, 66979, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a neat picture! I love the intent look the dog has watching the ball which shows motion blur very well. If the focus were a bit sharper and perhaps a bit less green it would be perfect to my eyes.</td>', 'What a neat picture! I love the intent look the dog has watching the ball which shows motion blur very well. If the focus were a bit sharper and perhaps a bit less green it would be perfect to my eyes.', '2004-03-29 04:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(642133, 66988, 8522, '<td valign="top">Impressive sharpness. Very eyecatching shot. The motion blur seems to be independent of the ball, as it is a slightly different size, and seems to carry on after the ball. I''m assuming this is due to use of a flash with a panning technique that didn''t match the speed of the ball.</td>', 'Impressive sharpness. Very eyecatching shot. The motion blur seems to be independent of the ball, as it is a slightly different size, and seems to carry on after the ball. I''m assuming this is due to use of a flash with a panning technique that didn''t match the speed of the ball.', '2004-03-29 04:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(642134, 67129, 8522, '<td valign="top">Good panning, I think a few things could have improved this...<br/>Flip the picture so he''s cycling from left to right<br/>Slower shutter speed to blur the background more.<br/>A clear background that doesn''t blend with or distract from his face.<br/>A more inspired background in general.<br/> <br/>I like the fact that you''ve left negative space for him to move into in this shot.</td>', 'Good panning, I think a few things could have improved this...Flip the picture so he''s cycling from left to rightSlower shutter speed to blur the background more.A clear background that doesn''t blend with or distract from his face.A more inspired background in general. I like the fact that you''ve left negative space for him to move into in this shot.', '2004-03-29 04:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(642135, 67172, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, well composed. This would really work for me without the orange noise on the left hand side of the frame. The lights on the horizon would work better without the ones in the middle that intersect with your subjects'' heads. This makes the shot look like an accident.</td>', 'Interesting shot, well composed. This would really work for me without the orange noise on the left hand side of the frame. The lights on the horizon would work better without the ones in the middle that intersect with your subjects'' heads. This makes the shot look like an accident.', '2004-03-29 04:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(642136, 66669, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great motion blur, well panned. Shame the background is too distracting though, especially the horizontal bar 1/3 way down the frame.</td>', 'Great motion blur, well panned. Shame the background is too distracting though, especially the horizontal bar 1/3 way down the frame.', '2004-03-29 04:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(642137, 67042, 8522, '<td valign="top">It''s clear you used a tripod, as there is a very impressive sharpness in this shot. However, the composition of these woods seems a bit uninspired, as if the camera was placed at the first opportunity. The pink of your subject is effective, but the shot doesn''t really say much to me. Maybe if more had been made with the possible atmosphere that a wood can contain, but here it all seems very ordinary.</td>', 'It''s clear you used a tripod, as there is a very impressive sharpness in this shot. However, the composition of these woods seems a bit uninspired, as if the camera was placed at the first opportunity. The pink of your subject is effective, but the shot doesn''t really say much to me. Maybe if more had been made with the possible atmosphere that a wood can contain, but here it all seems very ordinary.', '2004-03-29 04:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(642138, 66053, 8522, '<td valign="top">Why is the poppy blurry? And everything else?</td>', 'Why is the poppy blurry? And everything else?', '2004-03-29 04:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(642140, 67142, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, well composed and exposed. Shame about the noise, did you try NeatImage? The tiny amout of hair on the left (person off-frame) is offputting, I''d have included more, or cropped it out.</td>', 'Interesting shot, well composed and exposed. Shame about the noise, did you try NeatImage? The tiny amout of hair on the left (person off-frame) is offputting, I''d have included more, or cropped it out.', '2004-03-29 04:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(642141, 67018, 4008, '<td valign="top">I see motion, but I don''t see motion blur, looks pretty sharp to me. Some more thought to the angle of view to exclude the fence would also have improved the picture in my opinion.</td>', 'I see motion, but I don''t see motion blur, looks pretty sharp to me. Some more thought to the angle of view to exclude the fence would also have improved the picture in my opinion.', '2004-03-29 04:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(642142, 67138, 18512, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice and well composed shot. Congratulations!</td>', 'This is a really nice and well composed shot. Congratulations!', '2004-03-29 04:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(642143, 67176, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great idea, makes me want to try it! I''d be tempted to try various poses with the driver of the car (safety first of course!)... maybe interaction with a passenger would make it more interesting... or perhaps fiddling with some of the controls.</td>', 'Great idea, makes me want to try it! I''d be tempted to try various poses with the driver of the car (safety first of course!)... maybe interaction with a passenger would make it more interesting... or perhaps fiddling with some of the controls.', '2004-03-29 04:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(642144, 66889, 18512, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful!</td>', 'Simply beautiful!', '2004-03-29 04:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(642145, 67027, 18512, '<td valign="top">Very good shot. Nice movements.</td>', 'Very good shot. Nice movements.', '2004-03-29 04:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(642146, 67162, 18512, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but not to lucky with this shot.</td>', 'Good idea, but not to lucky with this shot.', '2004-03-29 04:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(642147, 66690, 18512, '<td valign="top">Nice observation, and well done!</td>', 'Nice observation, and well done!', '2004-03-29 04:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(642148, 67051, 8522, '<td valign="top">WOW, I love that eye! Great use of motion blur. I think you could do with a tighter crop though. I would flip the picture horizontally so he/she is looking from left to right, and crop tightly while leaving negative space on the right side of the frame. Shame about the dull colourless water, but I don''t think you could help that.</td>', 'WOW, I love that eye! Great use of motion blur. I think you could do with a tighter crop though. I would flip the picture horizontally so he/she is looking from left to right, and crop tightly while leaving negative space on the right side of the frame. Shame about the dull colourless water, but I don''t think you could help that.', '2004-03-29 04:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(642149, 67112, 8522, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great picture, but it''s far to small here for me to tell.</td>', 'I think this is a great picture, but it''s far to small here for me to tell.', '2004-03-29 04:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(642150, 67050, 18512, '<td valign="top">A Mercedes Benz, in motion. Nice colour-tones, and harmonic composition!</td>', 'A Mercedes Benz, in motion. Nice colour-tones, and harmonic composition!', '2004-03-29 04:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(642151, 67171, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great composition, good use of motion blur. I love the character of this shot. Impressive sharpness.</td>', 'Great composition, good use of motion blur. I love the character of this shot. Impressive sharpness.', '2004-03-29 04:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(642152, 67119, 18512, '<td valign="top">Very good! It would have been even better if we could see the girls'' face.  Well done.</td>', 'Very good! It would have been even better if we could see the girls'' face.  Well done.', '2004-03-29 04:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(642153, 66053, 18512, '<td valign="top">Are you serious???</td>', 'Are you serious???', '2004-03-29 04:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(642159, 67072, 18552, '<td valign="top">Really like your picture. The motion blur really enhances the subject of the picture. You did a fantastic job!</td>', 'Really like your picture. The motion blur really enhances the subject of the picture. You did a fantastic job!', '2004-03-29 04:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(642160, 67072, 16478, '<td valign="top">Shadow is the bottom right is a bit distracting, but apart from that a great photo</td>', 'Shadow is the bottom right is a bit distracting, but apart from that a great photo', '2004-03-29 04:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(642162, 67050, 18552, '<td valign="top">Really nice picture, good motion blur that really enhances the subject. Did you spell \"won''t\" incorrectly as \"wount\", in the title, on purpose? Perhaps it''s the cool, trendy way to say \"won''t\" kind of like \"kewl\" for cool.</td>', 'Really nice picture, good motion blur that really enhances the subject. Did you spell \"won''t\" incorrectly as \"wount\", in the title, on purpose? Perhaps it''s the cool, trendy way to say \"won''t\" kind of like \"kewl\" for cool.', '2004-03-29 04:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(642163, 66923, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very interesting picture. The motion is good but it doesn''t really enhance the subject matter as candles don''t normally move. I like it though - very neat effect. Is the word Verdigo in the title supposed to mean dizziness? If so, I think the word you meant to use is vertigo with a t.</td>', 'Very interesting picture. The motion is good but it doesn''t really enhance the subject matter as candles don''t normally move. I like it though - very neat effect. Is the word Verdigo in the title supposed to mean dizziness? If so, I think the word you meant to use is vertigo with a t.', '2004-03-29 04:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(642164, 66889, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a lovely picture. It is well composed and the motion blur really enhances the subject. Great Job!</td>', 'What a lovely picture. It is well composed and the motion blur really enhances the subject. Great Job!', '2004-03-29 05:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(642165, 67180, 5585, '<td valign="top">actually I really like this photo...should be more focused on the driver, but I guess the main "Focus" is there...lol wonderful colors... as I said this is good...and it is motion blur...</td>', 'actually I really like this photo...should be more focused on the driver, but I guess the main "Focus" is there...lol wonderful colors... as I said this is good...and it is motion blur...', '2004-03-29 05:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
