(642191, 66970, 18856, '<td valign="top">If I could vote this should be my favorite. 10 out of 10</td>', 'If I could vote this should be my favorite. 10 out of 10', '2004-03-29 05:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(642192, 67040, 10170, '<td valign="top">I have absolutely no idea how this was done, I hope the explanation tells me.  Excellent shot!</td>', 'I have absolutely no idea how this was done, I hope the explanation tells me.  Excellent shot!', '2004-03-29 06:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(642193, 66049, 10170, '<td valign="top">Great idea and nicely executed.  I like the selective desaturation here.</td>', 'Great idea and nicely executed.  I like the selective desaturation here.', '2004-03-29 06:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(642194, 66942, 10170, '<td valign="top">Excellent, a very emotive shot.  Great choice of sepia.</td>', 'Excellent, a very emotive shot.  Great choice of sepia.', '2004-03-29 06:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(642197, 66984, 13440, '<td valign="top">This is great shot! I can see those movements while the man subject is still sharp! Very nice panning, Good luck!</td>', 'This is great shot! I can see those movements while the man subject is still sharp! Very nice panning, Good luck!', '2004-03-29 06:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(642198, 67165, 13440, '<td valign="top">Nice moment you''ve captured. But i think it''s a bit too dark, otherwise It''d be great!</td>', 'Nice moment you''ve captured. But i think it''s a bit too dark, otherwise It''d be great!', '2004-03-29 06:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(642201, 67062, 7543, '<td valign="top">The background could be sharper, looks like its a bit moved as well. A tripod could have done the trick if it was not used. Good crop, I also like the head on the "overexposed" sky/sea.</td>', 'The background could be sharper, looks like its a bit moved as well. A tripod could have done the trick if it was not used. Good crop, I also like the head on the "overexposed" sky/sea.', '2004-03-29 06:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(642202, 67018, 7543, '<td valign="top">Good motion, I don''t see any blurring though. A slower shutter speed would have done the challenge better. Good pic though, nice composition.</td>', 'Good motion, I don''t see any blurring though. A slower shutter speed would have done the challenge better. Good pic though, nice composition.', '2004-03-29 07:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(642203, 67040, 7543, '<td valign="top">Good idea, great implementation.</td>', 'Good idea, great implementation.', '2004-03-29 07:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(642204, 66963, 7543, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark, cant make out what the hands are doing (on my screen now at least)</td>', 'A bit too dark, cant make out what the hands are doing (on my screen now at least)', '2004-03-29 07:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(642205, 66914, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Nice colors, can''t see motion blur though, blur seems to be caused by dof. good composition.</td>', 'Great shot. Nice colors, can''t see motion blur though, blur seems to be caused by dof. good composition.', '2004-03-29 07:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(642206, 66425, 15810, '<td valign="top">Fantastic, I love this shot, good to see something original (not cars) 10</td>', 'Fantastic, I love this shot, good to see something original (not cars) 10', '2004-03-29 07:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(642207, 67171, 15810, '<td valign="top">The best of the vehicle submissions, brilliantly done, I get a real feeling of speed. Great technique. 10</td>', 'The best of the vehicle submissions, brilliantly done, I get a real feeling of speed. Great technique. 10', '2004-03-29 07:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(642209, 67138, 15810, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Pity the sky wasnt more interesting. Well caught however, nice framing.</td>', 'Nice shot. Pity the sky wasnt more interesting. Well caught however, nice framing.', '2004-03-29 07:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(642210, 67176, 16004, '<td valign="top">It''s not really a criticism, but I might have liked to see a little less of the interior and a little more of what''s going on outside.  Maybe a zoom in and a little cropped from the bottom - a little less focus on the Focus, if you''ll excuse the pun.   I do like the contrast between the serene environment inside and the mad goings-on outside though...  I think a 7.</td>', 'It''s not really a criticism, but I might have liked to see a little less of the interior and a little more of what''s going on outside.  Maybe a zoom in and a little cropped from the bottom - a little less focus on the Focus, if you''ll excuse the pun.   I do like the contrast between the serene environment inside and the mad goings-on outside though...  I think a 7.', '2004-03-29 07:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(642212, 66449, 15810, '<td valign="top">Interesting / strange shot.  Normally the blur would suggest movement in a photo but your blur seems to be on the static chute and your subjects legs leaving the face crisp. This just sits uneasy for me as a viewer, I cant figure out easily whats going on. Sorry</td>', 'Interesting / strange shot.  Normally the blur would suggest movement in a photo but your blur seems to be on the static chute and your subjects legs leaving the face crisp. This just sits uneasy for me as a viewer, I cant figure out easily whats going on. Sorry', '2004-03-29 07:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(642213, 67042, 15810, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully surreal. The colurs are perfect and the blur is enough to make the shape distinguishable but only just. great work.</td>', 'Wonderfully surreal. The colurs are perfect and the blur is enough to make the shape distinguishable but only just. great work.', '2004-03-29 07:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(642214, 67080, 15810, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. May have been better by adjusting the levels post production to brighten the sky and darken the windmill. A blue cloudy sky would make this stunning. The next sunny day with clouds go back and do it again.</td>', 'Nice shot. May have been better by adjusting the levels post production to brighten the sky and darken the windmill. A blue cloudy sky would make this stunning. The next sunny day with clouds go back and do it again.', '2004-03-29 07:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(642215, 67162, 15810, '<td valign="top">interesting unique take on the challenge, I dontthink anyone else has blurred food. Nice idea but the whole thing is too busy for me, the blurred food is lost against the cluttered background.</td>', 'interesting unique take on the challenge, I dontthink anyone else has blurred food. Nice idea but the whole thing is too busy for me, the blurred food is lost against the cluttered background.', '2004-03-29 07:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(642216, 66927, 16004, '<td valign="top">The thing about pictures like this (of which this is a fantastic example) is that it makes me want to go out and spend 800 quid on a top notch camera.  This is excellent, easily falling within the remit of the challenge.  Especially impressed with the movement; makes me think that it could cause a hurricane in Borneo.  Nicely cropped too.  9.</td>', 'The thing about pictures like this (of which this is a fantastic example) is that it makes me want to go out and spend 800 quid on a top notch camera.  This is excellent, easily falling within the remit of the challenge.  Especially impressed with the movement; makes me think that it could cause a hurricane in Borneo.  Nicely cropped too.  9.', '2004-03-29 07:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(642217, 67089, 15810, '<td valign="top">Common theme. It would have been nice if either the cars or the road had been blurred rather than both.</td>', 'Common theme. It would have been nice if either the cars or the road had been blurred rather than both.', '2004-03-29 07:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(642218, 67133, 15810, '<td valign="top">Really nice. Odd crop though cutting off the lowest ball?</td>', 'Really nice. Odd crop though cutting off the lowest ball?', '2004-03-29 07:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(642219, 66049, 15810, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I dont really understand the movement though or the reason for it. I think there is an interesting story here but I need a little bit more information as a viewer.</td>', 'Nice idea. I dont really understand the movement though or the reason for it. I think there is an interesting story here but I need a little bit more information as a viewer.', '2004-03-29 07:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(642220, 67018, 14614, '<td valign="top">as presented nice shot (I really don''t see much motion blur, unfortuneatly)</td>', 'as presented nice shot (I really don''t see much motion blur, unfortuneatly)', '2004-03-29 07:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(642221, 67129, 14614, '<td valign="top">nicely panned, good cropping. fits the challenge well</td>', 'nicely panned, good cropping. fits the challenge well', '2004-03-29 07:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(642222, 67024, 16478, '<td valign="top">Is it just me or does this shot appear in every challenge? Afraid I can''t see much motion blur in this</td>', 'Is it just me or does this shot appear in every challenge? Afraid I can''t see much motion blur in this', '2004-03-29 07:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(642223, 66870, 16478, '<td valign="top">Whoa that''s crazy. I like it. 7</td>', 'Whoa that''s crazy. I like it. 7', '2004-03-29 07:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(642228, 66914, 18191, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the blur has no indication that the ladybug passed by.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the blur has no indication that the ladybug passed by.', '2004-03-29 08:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(642243, 67133, 10167, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!  Kind of wish the lower path hadn''t been cropped off, but I''ll get over it...  :)</td>', 'Very cool shot!  Kind of wish the lower path hadn''t been cropped off, but I''ll get over it...  :)', '2004-03-29 08:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(642244, 66925, 10167, '<td valign="top">Good idea and nicely done!</td>', 'Good idea and nicely done!', '2004-03-29 08:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(642245, 66669, 10167, '<td valign="top">Well done</td>', 'Well done', '2004-03-29 08:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(642247, 67031, 10167, '<td valign="top">nice job of panning...  very crisp!</td>', 'nice job of panning...  very crisp!', '2004-03-29 08:31:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(642248, 66638, 10167, '<td valign="top">neat shot</td>', 'neat shot', '2004-03-29 08:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(642251, 67016, 10167, '<td valign="top">very nice pan.  good job</td>', 'very nice pan.  good job', '2004-03-29 08:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(642259, 66983, 10167, '<td valign="top">too far overexposed in my opinion</td>', 'too far overexposed in my opinion', '2004-03-29 08:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(642268, 67018, 10167, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but I think you used too fast of a shutter speed for this challenge...  all of the motion is frozen!</td>', 'Good idea, but I think you used too fast of a shutter speed for this challenge...  all of the motion is frozen!', '2004-03-29 08:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(642271, 65955, 10167, '<td valign="top">cool idea.  think it would have worked better if you hadn''t hit the little bump in the road causing the jagged light trails.  Think it would have flowed a little better if they were all straight lines.  That said though, I realize it''s next to impossible in a car!</td>', 'cool idea.  think it would have worked better if you hadn''t hit the little bump in the road causing the jagged light trails.  Think it would have flowed a little better if they were all straight lines.  That said though, I realize it''s next to impossible in a car!', '2004-03-29 08:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(642278, 66638, 16004, '<td valign="top">I do like this image - though I''m not sure if the road incident adds  or detracts from the overall shot.  In my humblest opinion, the action to which the title refers isn''t prominent enough in the overall crop to make a striking impact - I wonder if the shot might not work better a little closer to the police van, and cropped so it''s without the admittedly nice, blue sky.  The impression of speed from the lights is a good touch - the world going on around the vehicles works well.  A bit of noise reduction might have helped, though (as would editting out the yellow slodges of glare).  I think it fits the challenge pretty well, and I think i''d like to award a 6.</td>', 'I do like this image - though I''m not sure if the road incident adds  or detracts from the overall shot.  In my humblest opinion, the action to which the title refers isn''t prominent enough in the overall crop to make a striking impact - I wonder if the shot might not work better a little closer to the police van, and cropped so it''s without the admittedly nice, blue sky.  The impression of speed from the lights is a good touch - the world going on around the vehicles works well.  A bit of noise reduction might have helped, though (as would editting out the yellow slodges of glare).  I think it fits the challenge pretty well, and I think i''d like to award a 6.', '2004-03-29 08:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(642282, 67112, 9941, '<td valign="top">Very nice blur, dynamic action.  Your shot could be larger though.</td>', 'Very nice blur, dynamic action.  Your shot could be larger though.', '2004-03-29 09:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(642283, 66966, 9941, '<td valign="top">Nice blur of a mundane image (I had a similar problem with my entry).</td>', 'Nice blur of a mundane image (I had a similar problem with my entry).', '2004-03-29 09:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(642284, 66425, 9941, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect.  I like this shot a lot.</td>', 'Very nice effect.  I like this shot a lot.', '2004-03-29 09:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(642285, 67016, 9941, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is what this challenge needs.  Great blur, lots of drama. 10 from me.</td>', 'Wow, this is what this challenge needs.  Great blur, lots of drama. 10 from me.', '2004-03-29 09:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(642288, 67016, 9982, '<td valign="top">The lines are so nearly horizontal. Just a little rotation would help.</td>', 'The lines are so nearly horizontal. Just a little rotation would help.', '2004-03-29 09:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(642289, 67018, 9982, '<td valign="top">Great pic but no blur</td>', 'Great pic but no blur', '2004-03-29 09:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(642291, 66966, 7543, '<td valign="top">Good blur, car sharp and the background is nicely blurred. Not very original but very well carried out.</td>', 'Good blur, car sharp and the background is nicely blurred. Not very original but very well carried out.', '2004-03-29 09:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(642292, 67051, 7543, '<td valign="top">nice expression on it''s face.</td>', 'nice expression on it''s face.', '2004-03-29 09:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(642294, 66970, 7543, '<td valign="top">Very nice, very nice indeed. Great colors, blending in the middle is just great. Great abstract-y looking. I would hang this on my wall. My favorite yet. Probably some people wont like it here, but I love it.</td>', 'Very nice, very nice indeed. Great colors, blending in the middle is just great. Great abstract-y looking. I would hang this on my wall. My favorite yet. Probably some people wont like it here, but I love it.', '2004-03-29 09:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(642295, 67064, 7543, '<td valign="top">Super capture, looks almost too good.</td>', 'Super capture, looks almost too good.', '2004-03-29 09:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(642297, 67047, 772, '<td valign="top">The subtle motion blur here is good.  The photo seems to lack context though.  Is she walking, running, riding a bike?  The background choice doens''t really support the subject well either.  = 3</td>', 'The subtle motion blur here is good.  The photo seems to lack context though.  Is she walking, running, riding a bike?  The background choice doens''t really support the subject well either.  = 3', '2004-03-29 09:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(642298, 67171, 7543, '<td valign="top">Good call on b/w.</td>', 'Good call on b/w.', '2004-03-29 09:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(642299, 66242, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo has some good potential.  The noise and odd color seems a bit strange to me... somewhat abstract.  = 4</td>', 'This photo has some good potential.  The noise and odd color seems a bit strange to me... somewhat abstract.  = 4', '2004-03-29 09:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(642304, 67116, 16126, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, nice colors, nice use of negative space.</td>', 'Nice picture, nice colors, nice use of negative space.', '2004-03-29 09:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(642305, 66985, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice panning... I like the composition you chose here as well... = 6</td>', 'Nice panning... I like the composition you chose here as well... = 6', '2004-03-29 09:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(642306, 67057, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting :)  I have seen some photos like this where the photographer simply kicked the tripod during the exposure to create some nice effect... = 6</td>', 'Interesting :)  I have seen some photos like this where the photographer simply kicked the tripod during the exposure to create some nice effect... = 6', '2004-03-29 09:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(642309, 67154, 772, '<td valign="top">The theme here is good.  Black and white also seems to work well.  I believe this is a case of a tad too much blur to support your theme.  The title tells me what I''m looking at, but without that, I would have had a difficult time determining the subject.  A little less blur would probably help add some definition without losing the theme of motion blur.. = 5</td>', 'The theme here is good.  Black and white also seems to work well.  I believe this is a case of a tad too much blur to support your theme.  The title tells me what I''m looking at, but without that, I would have had a difficult time determining the subject.  A little less blur would probably help add some definition without losing the theme of motion blur.. = 5', '2004-03-29 09:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(642310, 67124, 772, '<td valign="top">I believe this theme would work better in a setting where the falling dirt had a little more contrast with the background.  Since both are the same color, some of your motion gets lost... = 5</td>', 'I believe this theme would work better in a setting where the falling dirt had a little more contrast with the background.  Since both are the same color, some of your motion gets lost... = 5', '2004-03-29 09:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(642311, 65955, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the color and movement in this photo.  Interestingly enough, this seems quite ''chaotic'' to me :) = 7</td>', 'I like the color and movement in this photo.  Interestingly enough, this seems quite ''chaotic'' to me :) = 7', '2004-03-29 09:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(642314, 67007, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice theme... I like the more subtle motion you have provided here.  I think this image wold be improved with a horizontal flip to put the flag pole on the left to keep the flag in it''s proper orientation :) = 6</td>', 'Nice theme... I like the more subtle motion you have provided here.  I think this image wold be improved with a horizontal flip to put the flag pole on the left to keep the flag in it''s proper orientation :) = 6', '2004-03-29 09:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(642316, 67133, 772, '<td valign="top">I love to watch these desk gadgets moving :)  It looks like the flash and ambient light has interacted nicely with this subject also.  The crop at the bottom has me a bit puzzled...  I believe opening that up a little more would be beneficial... = 7</td>', 'I love to watch these desk gadgets moving :)  It looks like the flash and ambient light has interacted nicely with this subject also.  The crop at the bottom has me a bit puzzled...  I believe opening that up a little more would be beneficial... = 7', '2004-03-29 09:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(642320, 66870, 3087, '<td valign="top">What an unusual subject for motion blur! Somewhat disturbing result too! Idea is great - I think lighting isn''t strong - too uneven - harsh on one side and too much shadow on the other. But cool idea!</td>', 'What an unusual subject for motion blur! Somewhat disturbing result too! Idea is great - I think lighting isn''t strong - too uneven - harsh on one side and too much shadow on the other. But cool idea!', '2004-03-29 09:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(642321, 67062, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and there is something intriguing about the content. But it doesn''t quite seem to be focused in those areas that aren''t in motion - did you use a tripod?</td>', 'Nice composition and there is something intriguing about the content. But it doesn''t quite seem to be focused in those areas that aren''t in motion - did you use a tripod?', '2004-03-29 09:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(642322, 67023, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and I like that the motion itself is so integral to the subject. Nice choice for black and white.</td>', 'Very interesting and I like that the motion itself is so integral to the subject. Nice choice for black and white.', '2004-03-29 09:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(642324, 67003, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cool to get two in the frame. Shame about the large bins in the background. Like the lines between water and paths etc.</td>', 'Cool to get two in the frame. Shame about the large bins in the background. Like the lines between water and paths etc.', '2004-03-29 09:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(642325, 66979, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice! Great that he''s so still whilst the ball is in motion. I think this really would be much stronger if his paw was not out of frame - more attention to composition is needed. Content itself together with colours etc is great.</td>', 'Nice! Great that he''s so still whilst the ball is in motion. I think this really would be much stronger if his paw was not out of frame - more attention to composition is needed. Content itself together with colours etc is great.', '2004-03-29 09:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(642326, 67168, 3087, '<td valign="top">Personally I do need something in the image to be in better focus - there''s not enough that is still to contrast with the movement for me.</td>', 'Personally I do need something in the image to be in better focus - there''s not enough that is still to contrast with the movement for me.', '2004-03-29 09:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(642327, 66589, 772, '<td valign="top">Good motion capture...  I like the background streaks created by the panning.  The composition feels a little ''tight'' overall... maybe a little extra breathing room in front of the shoe would be an improvement in that area... = 5</td>', 'Good motion capture...  I like the background streaks created by the panning.  The composition feels a little ''tight'' overall... maybe a little extra breathing room in front of the shoe would be an improvement in that area... = 5', '2004-03-29 09:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(642329, 67163, 3087, '<td valign="top">Superbly composed - I love the sweeping corner of the dune and grass as well as the beautiful distant coastal rocks in the distance. This is a really strong image.</td>', 'Superbly composed - I love the sweeping corner of the dune and grass as well as the beautiful distant coastal rocks in the distance. This is a really strong image.', '2004-03-29 10:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(642330, 66988, 16004, '<td valign="top">hmm, either you are a very fast runner, or you are a bit of a dab hand with photoshop...  It''s reasonably convincing though i think it might be more so if you also applied a smidgeon of blur to the ball itself - it just looks like a too perfectly well-taken shot.  Still the impression of motion blur is there, and I personallu think it''s a well set-up shot.  8.</td>', 'hmm, either you are a very fast runner, or you are a bit of a dab hand with photoshop...  It''s reasonably convincing though i think it might be more so if you also applied a smidgeon of blur to the ball itself - it just looks like a too perfectly well-taken shot.  Still the impression of motion blur is there, and I personallu think it''s a well set-up shot.  8.', '2004-03-29 10:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(642331, 67051, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lol - I love that slightly demented look in his eye. Nicely captured motion with good strong focus on non-moving elements and great eye contact.</td>', 'Lol - I love that slightly demented look in his eye. Nicely captured motion with good strong focus on non-moving elements and great eye contact.', '2004-03-29 10:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(642332, 67133, 3087, '<td valign="top">Quirky - nice combination of light trails plus metal structure too. Dark night sky provides good background.</td>', 'Quirky - nice combination of light trails plus metal structure too. Dark night sky provides good background.', '2004-03-29 10:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(642333, 67064, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like the combination of freezing motion in one subject - what might be considered the main subject - and blurring in the other subjects - nicely done indeed.</td>', 'I really like the combination of freezing motion in one subject - what might be considered the main subject - and blurring in the other subjects - nicely done indeed.', '2004-03-29 10:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(642334, 66676, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent pannig job.. I know how difficult this shot can be.  I have tried quite a few myself with only a few decent results.  I think the only area for improvement would be moving the subject off dead center in the composition.  The noise level is also a bit high for a color image, IMO.  = 6</td>', 'Excellent pannig job.. I know how difficult this shot can be.  I have tried quite a few myself with only a few decent results.  I think the only area for improvement would be moving the subject off dead center in the composition.  The noise level is also a bit high for a color image, IMO.  = 6', '2004-03-29 10:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(642335, 67018, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very little actual motion blur captured although it''s clear from the content that the main subjects are in motion. Nice composition and lines.</td>', 'Very little actual motion blur captured although it''s clear from the content that the main subjects are in motion. Nice composition and lines.', '2004-03-29 10:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(642337, 67031, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice diagonals in the blurred background and great use of black and white to really make the focused main subject pop out from the background. Nice smile on her face too and I like that she''s moving into the empty part of the frame.</td>', 'Nice diagonals in the blurred background and great use of black and white to really make the focused main subject pop out from the background. Nice smile on her face too and I like that she''s moving into the empty part of the frame.', '2004-03-29 10:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(642338, 66289, 3087, '<td valign="top">An interesting image that essentially becomes an abstract of colour and shape.</td>', 'An interesting image that essentially becomes an abstract of colour and shape.', '2004-03-29 10:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(642339, 66942, 3087, '<td valign="top">Subtle use of motion blur in an interesting portrait. Composition a bit messy - the left hand area (his shoulder and background) doesn''t add anything and infact, because only her head is included, makes the proportions between them seem too out of balance. I''d crop the left a lot to make it a squarer image. Lighting is a touch harsh for my tastes.</td>', 'Subtle use of motion blur in an interesting portrait. Composition a bit messy - the left hand area (his shoulder and background) doesn''t add anything and infact, because only her head is included, makes the proportions between them seem too out of balance. I''d crop the left a lot to make it a squarer image. Lighting is a touch harsh for my tastes.', '2004-03-29 10:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(642341, 66988, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, crisp subject and nicely blurred background. Like the contrast of cool white and warm yellows.</td>', 'Nicely done, crisp subject and nicely blurred background. Like the contrast of cool white and warm yellows.', '2004-03-29 10:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(642343, 66970, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is like a painting and appeals to me a great deal, although I didn''t expect it to at first. I like that there is one bird towards the centre that is more in focus than the others. It has a very calming feel. Beautiful blue and gold colours.</td>', 'This is like a painting and appeals to me a great deal, although I didn''t expect it to at first. I like that there is one bird towards the centre that is more in focus than the others. It has a very calming feel. Beautiful blue and gold colours.', '2004-03-29 10:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(642344, 67059, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice pan... I think this image would be improved with a wider angle view, but the amount of pan blur in this photo is just about perfect :) = 7</td>', 'Nice pan... I think this image would be improved with a wider angle view, but the amount of pan blur in this photo is just about perfect :) = 7', '2004-03-29 10:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(642345, 66984, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured - great pose and I love that his legs are moving more than the rest.</td>', 'Nicely captured - great pose and I love that his legs are moving more than the rest.', '2004-03-29 10:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(642346, 67116, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice that his main body and face are still and that the ball and hand are in motion. That circle is nicely subtle. I think a closer crop would be better - the negative space adds nothing for me in this example. Lighting is also too "yellow".</td>', 'Nice that his main body and face are still and that the ball and hand are in motion. That circle is nicely subtle. I think a closer crop would be better - the negative space adds nothing for me in this example. Lighting is also too "yellow".', '2004-03-29 10:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(642347, 67133, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great shot, high impact. Shame the bottom car has been cropped, and the black background is noisy. The noise could easily have been sorted in Photoshop. I would have boosted red and green in the shadows a tad.</td>', 'Great shot, high impact. Shame the bottom car has been cropped, and the black background is noisy. The noise could easily have been sorted in Photoshop. I would have boosted red and green in the shadows a tad.', '2004-03-29 10:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(642348, 66690, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like those curves and the moving strangers - with the exception of the two in the left corner - they just seem to interrupt the flow for me.</td>', 'I like those curves and the moving strangers - with the exception of the two in the left corner - they just seem to interrupt the flow for me.', '2004-03-29 10:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(642349, 67169, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but the motion blur is a bit subtle for me here, and I REALLY dislike your border which draws the eye away from the photo and is quite ugly.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but the motion blur is a bit subtle for me here, and I REALLY dislike your border which draws the eye away from the photo and is quite ugly.', '2004-03-29 10:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(642350, 67145, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice zoom burst :)  This photo could possibly be strengthened by having the subject closer to center to create some extra definition.  The issue I have with this image is that it feels more like a software generated burst than one in cam.  I re-read the challenge description and it looks like it changed again... It no longer says anything about creating the effect in cam.... = 5</td>', 'Nice zoom burst :)  This photo could possibly be strengthened by having the subject closer to center to create some extra definition.  The issue I have with this image is that it feels more like a software generated burst than one in cam.  I re-read the challenge description and it looks like it changed again... It no longer says anything about creating the effect in cam.... = 5', '2004-03-29 10:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(642351, 66889, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice combo of motion and stillness and I like the blurred wings and water droplets,</td>', 'Nice combo of motion and stillness and I like the blurred wings and water droplets,', '2004-03-29 10:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(642352, 66425, 3087, '<td valign="top">A dynamic image that I can see on the front of a magazine. Nice composition and nice focus on  the central JOE''S text at different zooms.</td>', 'A dynamic image that I can see on the front of a magazine. Nice composition and nice focus on  the central JOE''S text at different zooms.', '2004-03-29 10:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(642355, 66934, 7970, '<td valign="top">Great shot, Like the idea v much.</td>', 'Great shot, Like the idea v much.', '2004-03-29 10:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(642356, 66795, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative, I look forward to reading how you did this. I personally would have flipped the photo horizontally to exploit the top-left to bottom-right diagonal which is easier on the eye.</td>', 'Very imaginative, I look forward to reading how you did this. I personally would have flipped the photo horizontally to exploit the top-left to bottom-right diagonal which is easier on the eye.', '2004-03-29 10:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(642358, 67057, 7970, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.....how did u do that?</td>', 'Wonderful.....how did u do that?', '2004-03-29 10:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(642359, 67063, 7970, '<td valign="top">great contrast of color making shot more lively... good job.</td>', 'great contrast of color making shot more lively... good job.', '2004-03-29 10:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(642360, 67116, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but seems a little overexposed... there are burnt out highlights on the boy''s face. Too much NeatImage appears to have been used, as everything has a very plastic/ posterised texture. I would have liked a much tighter crop. Shame about the shadow which has been thrown across the boy''s top.</td>', 'Nice shot, but seems a little overexposed... there are burnt out highlights on the boy''s face. Too much NeatImage appears to have been used, as everything has a very plastic/ posterised texture. I would have liked a much tighter crop. Shame about the shadow which has been thrown across the boy''s top.', '2004-03-29 10:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(642363, 66942, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice adaptation of Ursula''s ''whispers and giggles'' picture. Great exposure and lighting. Effective motion blur. Good range of tones captured.</td>', 'Nice adaptation of Ursula''s ''whispers and giggles'' picture. Great exposure and lighting. Effective motion blur. Good range of tones captured.', '2004-03-29 10:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(642364, 66446, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting... almost surreal. Great IR.</td>', 'Interesting... almost surreal. Great IR.', '2004-03-29 10:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(642366, 67128, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a great idea! Shame the foreground is so noisy, and I would have liked to see more dof on the wing. Perhaps stronger lighting could have helped you with this.</td>', 'Wow, what a great idea! Shame the foreground is so noisy, and I would have liked to see more dof on the wing. Perhaps stronger lighting could have helped you with this.', '2004-03-29 10:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(642367, 66795, 7543, '<td valign="top">Not very original, but very very well done, could be in a brochure from the carmaker.</td>', 'Not very original, but very very well done, could be in a brochure from the carmaker.', '2004-03-29 10:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(642368, 66983, 12827, '<td valign="top">All the detail has been washed out, I would like to see this with some detail.</td>', 'All the detail has been washed out, I would like to see this with some detail.', '2004-03-29 10:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(642370, 66870, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very freaky, makes me feel uncomfortable looking at it. Good lighting, well composed. Perhaps a run through NeatImage might have helped?</td>', 'Very freaky, makes me feel uncomfortable looking at it. Good lighting, well composed. Perhaps a run through NeatImage might have helped?', '2004-03-29 10:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(642371, 66984, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nice capture!</td>', 'Nice capture!', '2004-03-29 10:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(642375, 67048, 8522, '<td valign="top">Unusual and interesting composition. Lack of stationary detail means there is no effective motion blur to contrast with the panned boxcar. You seem to have caught the side away from the sun, which has resulted in flat lighting and a distracting shadow.</td>', 'Unusual and interesting composition. Lack of stationary detail means there is no effective motion blur to contrast with the panned boxcar. You seem to have caught the side away from the sun, which has resulted in flat lighting and a distracting shadow.', '2004-03-29 10:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(642376, 67112, 12827, '<td valign="top">too small, don''t feel bad though, I have made the same mistake!:)</td>', 'too small, don''t feel bad though, I have made the same mistake!:)', '2004-03-29 10:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(642377, 66676, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, great panning of a difficult to capture subject. However, a few things could improve your shot. If you have to centre any part of an animal, centre the eyes. This is the focus. With a shot like this though, have the bird at the edge of the frame flying into plenty of negative space. I would flip the picture horizontally so he is flying from left to right. And I would select the background, and adjust the colours/levels so that the subject is seperated from the background more.</td>', 'Wow, great panning of a difficult to capture subject. However, a few things could improve your shot. If you have to centre any part of an animal, centre the eyes. This is the focus. With a shot like this though, have the bird at the edge of the frame flying into plenty of negative space. I would flip the picture horizontally so he is flying from left to right. And I would select the background, and adjust the colours/levels so that the subject is seperated from the background more.', '2004-03-29 10:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(642379, 67074, 1368, '<td valign="top">Is it on top of a truck or something?</td>', 'Is it on top of a truck or something?', '2004-03-29 10:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(642381, 66970, 18433, '<td valign="top">Love this one.  Love the colors and the overall feeling. 10.</td>', 'Love this one.  Love the colors and the overall feeling. 10.', '2004-03-29 10:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(642383, 67124, 12802, '<td valign="top">Really good shot here, find it a little hard to see the dirt because of your background though.  You''ve used your long exposure well, the hand is nice and steady, whilst the dirt is ''flowing'' looking. Well done!</td>', 'Really good shot here, find it a little hard to see the dirt because of your background though.  You''ve used your long exposure well, the hand is nice and steady, whilst the dirt is ''flowing'' looking. Well done!', '2004-03-29 10:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(642385, 67039, 12802, '<td valign="top">Very good, great idea for the challenge, something that we can all relate to.  This does look really good!  She is perfectly in focus, the background whizzing past looks brilliant!  Slight overexposure on her top, but I really like this!</td>', 'Very good, great idea for the challenge, something that we can all relate to.  This does look really good!  She is perfectly in focus, the background whizzing past looks brilliant!  Slight overexposure on her top, but I really like this!', '2004-03-29 10:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(642386, 67040, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, very creative and imaginative shot. Shame the skin tone seems a little off. I''d like to have seen the arms not cropped. Model has a great expression.</td>', 'Wow, very creative and imaginative shot. Shame the skin tone seems a little off. I''d like to have seen the arms not cropped. Model has a great expression.', '2004-03-29 10:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(642388, 67112, 10686, '<td valign="top">neat shot, too small though</td>', 'neat shot, too small though', '2004-03-29 10:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(642391, 67027, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great motion blur... I''d have flipped the photo so he was running from left to right. Possibly a tighter crop on the left so he is about to run out of the frame would make this look a lot more dynamic. Perhaps a boost on green in shadows, and a decrease on cyan in highlights would help as well.</td>', 'Great motion blur... I''d have flipped the photo so he was running from left to right. Possibly a tighter crop on the left so he is about to run out of the frame would make this look a lot more dynamic. Perhaps a boost on green in shadows, and a decrease on cyan in highlights would help as well.', '2004-03-29 10:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(642393, 67016, 16739, '<td valign="top">great shot , should be top two</td>', 'great shot , should be top two', '2004-03-29 10:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(642395, 66923, 4338, '<td valign="top">nice zoom blur, I tried this but failed....nice capture</td>', 'nice zoom blur, I tried this but failed....nice capture', '2004-03-29 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(642396, 67112, 4338, '<td valign="top">excelent motion blur, however the image size is a bit too small</td>', 'excelent motion blur, however the image size is a bit too small', '2004-03-29 10:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
