(642403, 67172, 8970, '<td valign="top">I love the blurring of the people in the picture, but those lights in the background are too distracting.</td>', 'I love the blurring of the people in the picture, but those lights in the background are too distracting.', '2004-03-29 10:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
