(642405, 67161, 8970, '<td valign="top">I wish the cyclist in the foreground was perfectly in focus with the one in the back blurred, otherwise it is a great choice of shot.</td>', 'I wish the cyclist in the foreground was perfectly in focus with the one in the back blurred, otherwise it is a great choice of shot.', '2004-03-29 10:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(642409, 66953, 8970, '<td valign="top">The resolution seems rather poor, makes me believe that this was blown up a lot.  If it wasn''t for that it makes for a good choice.</td>', 'The resolution seems rather poor, makes me believe that this was blown up a lot.  If it wasn''t for that it makes for a good choice.', '2004-03-29 10:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(642410, 67064, 4338, '<td valign="top">excellent blur, very well done</td>', 'excellent blur, very well done', '2004-03-29 10:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(642412, 67089, 16004, '<td valign="top">This had a good potential (two cars together is different and difficult) but it just looks too blurry.  If you used a shorter exposure or panned a little bit as the vehicles went passed (like the people who did the VW and Mercedes) the cars might have had a little more definition, and I think the impression of speed would be improved.  I still think it is a fine effort - the bold colours work well and it still fits the challenge.  5.</td>', 'This had a good potential (two cars together is different and difficult) but it just looks too blurry.  If you used a shorter exposure or panned a little bit as the vehicles went passed (like the people who did the VW and Mercedes) the cars might have had a little more definition, and I think the impression of speed would be improved.  I still think it is a fine effort - the bold colours work well and it still fits the challenge.  5.', '2004-03-29 11:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(642413, 67039, 4338, '<td valign="top">very cool shot</td>', 'very cool shot', '2004-03-29 11:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(642418, 66970, 17200, '<td valign="top">This is so cool, it''s almost like a painting, great work!</td>', 'This is so cool, it''s almost like a painting, great work!', '2004-03-29 11:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(642419, 67161, 17200, '<td valign="top">I rated this very high, but I wish the foreground biker was a tiny bit sharper.  But I love the composition and the alignment and color of the other biker nicely contrasts the main one. 9!</td>', 'I rated this very high, but I wish the foreground biker was a tiny bit sharper.  But I love the composition and the alignment and color of the other biker nicely contrasts the main one. 9!', '2004-03-29 11:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(642420, 66425, 17200, '<td valign="top">Just wonderful! Nice and clear, very cool!</td>', 'Just wonderful! Nice and clear, very cool!', '2004-03-29 11:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(642421, 66979, 17200, '<td valign="top">It''s a little grainy, but I really appreciate that *everything* is in focus except the ball in motion. That must have been a pain and I bet you had a lot of takes!</td>', 'It''s a little grainy, but I really appreciate that *everything* is in focus except the ball in motion. That must have been a pain and I bet you had a lot of takes!', '2004-03-29 11:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(642422, 66889, 8643, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous - love the spray to the left.</td>', 'Gorgeous - love the spray to the left.', '2004-03-29 11:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(642424, 67016, 17200, '<td valign="top">The biker is SO sharp, excellent job! I think the blue "thingy" (maybe the woman''s umbrella?) is distracting, but not too much. Great job!</td>', 'The biker is SO sharp, excellent job! I think the blue "thingy" (maybe the woman''s umbrella?) is distracting, but not too much. Great job!', '2004-03-29 11:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(642426, 66771, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and lovely colours, but I wish the shark was more sharp. Your picture seems very pixellated... is this because of NeatImage?</td>', 'Great idea, and lovely colours, but I wish the shark was more sharp. Your picture seems very pixellated... is this because of NeatImage?', '2004-03-29 11:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(642427, 66966, 16004, '<td valign="top">You don''t know how much I envy this shot - I tried and tried but could not et such a good definition on a moving image.  Techinically, I don''t think I can fault this - I would add that personal taste finds a white van a little uninteresting, and it''s a pity you have lost the extreme back end.  But overall I am thoroughly impressed.  9.</td>', 'You don''t know how much I envy this shot - I tried and tried but could not et such a good definition on a moving image.  Techinically, I don''t think I can fault this - I would add that personal taste finds a white van a little uninteresting, and it''s a pity you have lost the extreme back end.  But overall I am thoroughly impressed.  9.', '2004-03-29 11:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(642429, 67123, 17200, '<td valign="top">I love wolves so I wanted to rate this high, but it just doesn''t quite do it for me. Maybe if the back leg that''s in the air was a little easier to see... it would make him (or her?) look more in motion. Still, nice pic!</td>', 'I love wolves so I wanted to rate this high, but it just doesn''t quite do it for me. Maybe if the back leg that''s in the air was a little easier to see... it would make him (or her?) look more in motion. Still, nice pic!', '2004-03-29 11:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(642431, 66827, 17200, '<td valign="top">If I could make out some kind of detail, I would have rated this higher. Otherwise it just looks like a blur.</td>', 'If I could make out some kind of detail, I would have rated this higher. Otherwise it just looks like a blur.', '2004-03-29 11:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(642432, 66963, 17200, '<td valign="top">I like the concept a lot, I just wish there was a little more light on the baker.</td>', 'I like the concept a lot, I just wish there was a little more light on the baker.', '2004-03-29 11:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(642433, 67034, 8522, '<td valign="top">Too much green here, and the white flowers are overexposed. Nice detail in the wings though.</td>', 'Too much green here, and the white flowers are overexposed. Nice detail in the wings though.', '2004-03-29 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(642434, 67177, 17200, '<td valign="top">I rated this average at first, but after studying it more, I''m bumping it up a few notches. Good color, motion blur, composition, etc...</td>', 'I rated this average at first, but after studying it more, I''m bumping it up a few notches. Good color, motion blur, composition, etc...', '2004-03-29 11:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(642435, 67039, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great idea, shame about the noise levels and blue tint to the skin tones.</td>', 'Great idea, shame about the noise levels and blue tint to the skin tones.', '2004-03-29 11:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(642436, 66771, 17200, '<td valign="top">IMHO, in this challenge, something in the pic has to be in focus, the whole thing can''t be a blur (generally speaking).</td>', 'IMHO, in this challenge, something in the pic has to be in focus, the whole thing can''t be a blur (generally speaking).', '2004-03-29 11:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(642437, 67047, 17200, '<td valign="top">Nice clean, smooth pic. I would like to see more of her and less of the SUV though, heh heh. Good job though.</td>', 'Nice clean, smooth pic. I would like to see more of her and less of the SUV though, heh heh. Good job though.', '2004-03-29 11:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(642438, 67117, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely sillhouettes. This may seem a small point, but with so much simplicity in your shot it is obvious that your border is uneven.</td>', 'Lovely sillhouettes. This may seem a small point, but with so much simplicity in your shot it is obvious that your border is uneven.', '2004-03-29 11:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(642439, 67023, 17200, '<td valign="top">Dark, grainy, moody... and I mean that in a good way!</td>', 'Dark, grainy, moody... and I mean that in a good way!', '2004-03-29 11:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(642441, 67023, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful... I''d have liked a closer crop though.</td>', 'Wonderful... I''d have liked a closer crop though.', '2004-03-29 11:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(642442, 66984, 8522, '<td valign="top">Superb panning, crystal clear... shame the background is too busy.</td>', 'Superb panning, crystal clear... shame the background is too busy.', '2004-03-29 11:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(642443, 67018, 8522, '<td valign="top">Don''t see much motion blur.</td>', 'Don''t see much motion blur.', '2004-03-29 11:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(642449, 66962, 16004, '<td valign="top">I can see what''s going on, but i think there was just a bit too much exposure, and the spinning coin has no real definition  it does give the impression that the stationary coin is having a bit of a daydream (am I right?) but it just doesn''t look right overall  The background is too plain / black / without form as well.  I like the concept though, and it does fit the challenge  erm, 4.</td>', 'I can see what''s going on, but i think there was just a bit too much exposure, and the spinning coin has no real definition  it does give the impression that the stationary coin is having a bit of a daydream (am I right?) but it just doesn''t look right overall  The background is too plain / black / without form as well.  I like the concept though, and it does fit the challenge  erm, 4.', '2004-03-29 11:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(642457, 66795, 12827, '<td valign="top">How did you mount this?!</td>', 'How did you mount this?!', '2004-03-29 11:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(642462, 66988, 5955, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, very nice job</td>', 'Awesome shot, very nice job', '2004-03-29 11:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(642466, 66638, 12827, '<td valign="top">I like the police!</td>', 'I like the police!', '2004-03-29 11:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(642470, 66951, 16004, '<td valign="top">Cute, but really I thought that the image is too big and the sponge is too small - a bit more of an aggressive crop and more focus in the lads face and the sponge might have made what''s going on more immediately apparent and more involving for the viewer.  It''s a nice idea, but I personally do not think that in this case the picture is enhanced by the motion blur.  The clarity of colours and the focus is largely top notch though, and it is a likeable image.  5.</td>', 'Cute, but really I thought that the image is too big and the sponge is too small - a bit more of an aggressive crop and more focus in the lads face and the sponge might have made what''s going on more immediately apparent and more involving for the viewer.  It''s a nice idea, but I personally do not think that in this case the picture is enhanced by the motion blur.  The clarity of colours and the focus is largely top notch though, and it is a likeable image.  5.', '2004-03-29 11:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(642477, 67143, 9941, '<td valign="top">Very nice, excellent shot.</td>', 'Very nice, excellent shot.', '2004-03-29 11:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(642485, 66795, 5176, '<td valign="top">excellent photo would have made a good magazine cover too</td>', 'excellent photo would have made a good magazine cover too', '2004-03-29 12:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(642488, 66425, 5176, '<td valign="top">great picture very sharp zoom start and finish like it</td>', 'great picture very sharp zoom start and finish like it', '2004-03-29 12:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(642497, 66942, 16004, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but i''m not overtly keen on the motion of the fingers ; looks like the girl is being gently slapped on the nose.  This would in fact be a FANTASTIC picture if the hand were not there at all, and if this was not a motion blur-type challenge.  It''s a truly lovely picture, but sadly is not enhanced by MB.  The black and white style here is totally suitable, and it looks really good.  Any other challenge minus fingers, 9.  Unfortunately here I can only offer 7.</td>', 'Sorry, but i''m not overtly keen on the motion of the fingers ; looks like the girl is being gently slapped on the nose.  This would in fact be a FANTASTIC picture if the hand were not there at all, and if this was not a motion blur-type challenge.  It''s a truly lovely picture, but sadly is not enhanced by MB.  The black and white style here is totally suitable, and it looks really good.  Any other challenge minus fingers, 9.  Unfortunately here I can only offer 7.', '2004-03-29 12:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(642506, 67128, 772, '<td valign="top">Good theme here.. a little more light on the wing could create some improvement possibly... = 5</td>', 'Good theme here.. a little more light on the wing could create some improvement possibly... = 5', '2004-03-29 12:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(642508, 67039, 16004, '<td valign="top">Stone me, can I relate to this!  With regards of enhancing your image by use of MB, I must say this is one of the best examples I''ve seen.  Technically, I thought that the image of the model is a bit noisy / pixelated - a gentle wash with NeatIamge type things would have helped a little bit.  And a bit of gentle editting (with a clone brush perhaps) around the chair might have helped smooth the border between the fore and background.  But it conveys your idea so brilliantly.   So, slightly flawed but still genius; 9.</td>', 'Stone me, can I relate to this!  With regards of enhancing your image by use of MB, I must say this is one of the best examples I''ve seen.  Technically, I thought that the image of the model is a bit noisy / pixelated - a gentle wash with NeatIamge type things would have helped a little bit.  And a bit of gentle editting (with a clone brush perhaps) around the chair might have helped smooth the border between the fore and background.  But it conveys your idea so brilliantly.   So, slightly flawed but still genius; 9.', '2004-03-29 12:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(642509, 67171, 772, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot... Black and white was a good choice here also.. the contrasts are excellent.  This photo seems to create some intimacy between the two on the motorcycle... great work :) = 10</td>', 'I really like this shot... Black and white was a good choice here also.. the contrasts are excellent.  This photo seems to create some intimacy between the two on the motorcycle... great work :) = 10', '2004-03-29 12:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(642513, 67116, 772, '<td valign="top">Good blur... this possibly lacks interest in composition.  The negative space doesn''t add much to the theme for me.  = 5</td>', 'Good blur... this possibly lacks interest in composition.  The negative space doesn''t add much to the theme for me.  = 5', '2004-03-29 12:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(642514, 67062, 772, '<td valign="top">The motion blur in this photo is nice.  Compositionally, I would prefer some open space on the right side of the frame rather than the left.  It would give the subject room to ''move'' within the frame... = 7</td>', 'The motion blur in this photo is nice.  Compositionally, I would prefer some open space on the right side of the frame rather than the left.  It would give the subject room to ''move'' within the frame... = 7', '2004-03-29 12:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(642516, 66690, 16004, '<td valign="top">Nice, but other than the two folks on the left, not a lot of MB is going on, and I''m not entirely sure that they enhance the image...   Picture also seems a little noisy too...   It''s certainly a cool tunnel though, but sadly I''m not convinced that it truly fits the challenge.  It would have been great for parallel lines though...</td>', 'Nice, but other than the two folks on the left, not a lot of MB is going on, and I''m not entirely sure that they enhance the image...   Picture also seems a little noisy too...   It''s certainly a cool tunnel though, but sadly I''m not convinced that it truly fits the challenge.  It would have been great for parallel lines though...', '2004-03-29 12:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(642518, 66827, 16004, '<td valign="top">Too much MB - I can barely discern what''s going on.  As a piece of art on it''s own merits, I think it''s rather appealing - a big version on the wall in a restuarant would probably look really fab.  But here, for the particular challenge, I think it''s too messy.</td>', 'Too much MB - I can barely discern what''s going on.  As a piece of art on it''s own merits, I think it''s rather appealing - a big version on the wall in a restuarant would probably look really fab.  But here, for the particular challenge, I think it''s too messy.', '2004-03-29 12:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(642527, 66799, 3569, '<td valign="top">A bit too overexposed to me.</td>', 'A bit too overexposed to me.', '2004-03-29 12:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(642528, 66914, 3569, '<td valign="top">To me, this doesn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'To me, this doesn''t meet the challenge.', '2004-03-29 12:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(642532, 67143, 3569, '<td valign="top">Can feel the speed, nice shot.</td>', 'Can feel the speed, nice shot.', '2004-03-29 12:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(642535, 67003, 3569, '<td valign="top">Excellent Black-bellied whistling Ducks in flight. .  Definately shows motion in background.</td>', 'Excellent Black-bellied whistling Ducks in flight. .  Definately shows motion in background.', '2004-03-29 12:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(642537, 66676, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice goose.  Motion right on.</td>', 'Nice goose.  Motion right on.', '2004-03-29 13:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(642551, 66970, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice work... Feels quite surreal.. = 9</td>', 'Very nice work... Feels quite surreal.. = 9', '2004-03-29 13:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(642558, 66970, 11843, '<td valign="top">As an abstract, this is awesome! 10</td>', 'As an abstract, this is awesome! 10', '2004-03-29 13:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
