(642574, 66795, 11843, '<td valign="top">It''ll be interesting to see how you got this shot. Mounted on outside of car or someone hangin out on the hood. 10</td>', 'It''ll be interesting to see how you got this shot. Mounted on outside of car or someone hangin out on the hood. 10', '2004-03-29 13:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(642583, 67018, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this shot over all but I don''t see much motion blur. &lt;?&gt;</td>', 'I like this shot over all but I don''t see much motion blur. <?>', '2004-03-29 13:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(642585, 67160, 772, '<td valign="top">Good blur... the redness feels a bit odd.  = 5</td>', 'Good blur... the redness feels a bit odd.  = 5', '2004-03-29 13:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(642586, 67031, 11843, '<td valign="top">This is very well done. I like that you made it look like she is riding downhill. Kinda adds to the impression that she is going really fast. It looks like she is having fun too, which captures mood. Add that to motion and you get Great! 10</td>', 'This is very well done. I like that you made it look like she is riding downhill. Kinda adds to the impression that she is going really fast. It looks like she is having fun too, which captures mood. Add that to motion and you get Great! 10', '2004-03-29 13:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(642588, 67142, 327, '<td valign="top">I like the light for the most part in this photo. I don''t like the crop...maybe tighter on the right side would of helped to narrow the view.</td>', 'I like the light for the most part in this photo. I don''t like the crop...maybe tighter on the right side would of helped to narrow the view.', '2004-03-29 13:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(642589, 67039, 772, '<td valign="top">Looks like an Excedrin headache :) = 5</td>', 'Looks like an Excedrin headache :) = 5', '2004-03-29 13:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(642590, 67051, 11843, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious! I like how the motion is captured around the dogs eye. 10</td>', 'This is hilarious! I like how the motion is captured around the dogs eye. 10', '2004-03-29 13:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(642594, 67133, 11843, '<td valign="top">I would have given this a 10 had the base been included. It feels incomplete and cut off. Still nice capture of movement. 9</td>', 'I would have given this a 10 had the base been included. It feels incomplete and cut off. Still nice capture of movement. 9', '2004-03-29 13:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(642599, 66984, 11843, '<td valign="top">This definitely has that WOW factor going on! How He Do That? (; 10</td>', 'This definitely has that WOW factor going on! How He Do That? (; 10', '2004-03-29 13:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(642616, 67034, 12962, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  The colors are nice with different shades of green contrasting with the white.  The DOF is also excellent.  Too bad that the white flowers don''t have much definition (overexposed?).   If you want to do this again, play around with the aperture like jacking it up to a higher number (smaller opening) but keep your time the same.  But if you already know this, my apologies.  Good job!</td>', 'Beautiful.  The colors are nice with different shades of green contrasting with the white.  The DOF is also excellent.  Too bad that the white flowers don''t have much definition (overexposed?).   If you want to do this again, play around with the aperture like jacking it up to a higher number (smaller opening) but keep your time the same.  But if you already know this, my apologies.  Good job!', '2004-03-29 14:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(642631, 67174, 18800, '<td valign="top">there could''ve been more done to the photo to enhance that reflecting colors</td>', 'there could''ve been more done to the photo to enhance that reflecting colors', '2004-03-29 14:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
