(643153, 66969, 4285, '<td valign="top">Great capture, nice and crisp in the middle of the car. A little more room in front of the car would add to the feeling of going somewhere. Was this taken with the window up in your car? Just seems like reflections, ie. above the sun roof - just a little distracting. Overall good job.</td>', 'Great capture, nice and crisp in the middle of the car. A little more room in front of the car would add to the feeling of going somewhere. Was this taken with the window up in your car? Just seems like reflections, ie. above the sun roof - just a little distracting. Overall good job.', '2004-03-29 20:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(643154, 67155, 18191, '<td valign="top">What happens if you are touching the mirror...how can it be closer than you appear????!</td>', 'What happens if you are touching the mirror...how can it be closer than you appear????!', '2004-03-29 20:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(643162, 66914, 4285, '<td valign="top">The trail behind the bug is the motion blur? I really don''t find the colours very flattering. Might not be easy to capture, but if you were trying to get the motion of the ladybug with a long exposure, a plain, preferably dark background would work best. Also if you are going to use flash (for most any shot) you should bounce it or diffuse it. Hope you find this helpful.</td>', 'The trail behind the bug is the motion blur? I really don''t find the colours very flattering. Might not be easy to capture, but if you were trying to get the motion of the ladybug with a long exposure, a plain, preferably dark background would work best. Also if you are going to use flash (for most any shot) you should bounce it or diffuse it. Hope you find this helpful.', '2004-03-29 20:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(643165, 67174, 4285, '<td valign="top">I''m seeing blur but I don''t think it is motion blur - it looks like out of focus blur to me.  I''d really like to be able to offer some advice on how to improve this shot but I''m not really sure what you were trying to accomplish. Sorry I couldn''t help or say something positive. Keep working on it. :)</td>', 'I''m seeing blur but I don''t think it is motion blur - it looks like out of focus blur to me.  I''d really like to be able to offer some advice on how to improve this shot but I''m not really sure what you were trying to accomplish. Sorry I couldn''t help or say something positive. Keep working on it. :)', '2004-03-29 20:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(643170, 67163, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture. I think you might have gotten some of the motion blur from editing as the water doesn''t seem to show much blur.</td>', 'This is a nice picture. I think you might have gotten some of the motion blur from editing as the water doesn''t seem to show much blur.', '2004-03-29 20:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(643173, 66053, 4285, '<td valign="top">Your blur may have been the effect of wind or motion but to me it just looks out of focus/shallow DOF with the ground in relative focus. Can''t really add anything that would improve the shot because I''m not sure what you were trying to accomplish. Sorry. Keep on plugging at it. :)</td>', 'Your blur may have been the effect of wind or motion but to me it just looks out of focus/shallow DOF with the ground in relative focus. Can''t really add anything that would improve the shot because I''m not sure what you were trying to accomplish. Sorry. Keep on plugging at it. :)', '2004-03-29 20:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(643195, 67154, 4285, '<td valign="top">If you had kept your iron in one place longer for part of the exposure or used a bounced flash, it would have made it stand out more. That way the viewer wouldn''t have try and figure out where the iron is in the image. If it wasn''t for your title I really would have had no idea what it was. I really think your idea was good but it was not executed as well as it could have been. Hope this was helpful. :)</td>', 'If you had kept your iron in one place longer for part of the exposure or used a bounced flash, it would have made it stand out more. That way the viewer wouldn''t have try and figure out where the iron is in the image. If it wasn''t for your title I really would have had no idea what it was. I really think your idea was good but it was not executed as well as it could have been. Hope this was helpful. :)', '2004-03-29 20:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(643210, 66151, 4285, '<td valign="top">Slower shutter would have conveyed more speed/blur. I can see a little blur in the hub caps but the trees/hedge look more like shallow DOF to me. Hope this helps. :)</td>', 'Slower shutter would have conveyed more speed/blur. I can see a little blur in the hub caps but the trees/hedge look more like shallow DOF to me. Hope this helps. :)', '2004-03-29 20:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(643214, 66942, 18191, '<td valign="top">Top 5 of mine, great clarity</td>', 'Top 5 of mine, great clarity', '2004-03-29 20:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(643227, 67040, 4285, '<td valign="top">Let me see if I can figure this out. You exposed the model and the clothes pins with flash in the dark. She moved and turned on the light. Then you zoomed wide to get the streaks and finish the shot. Well executed Heida?</td>', 'Let me see if I can figure this out. You exposed the model and the clothes pins with flash in the dark. She moved and turned on the light. Then you zoomed wide to get the streaks and finish the shot. Well executed Heida?', '2004-03-29 20:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(643229, 67179, 4285, '<td valign="top">Reminiscent of Swish by alansfreed, the winner of the Garbage challenge. Well executed. Good luck.</td>', 'Reminiscent of Swish by alansfreed, the winner of the Garbage challenge. Well executed. Good luck.', '2004-03-29 21:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(643239, 66966, 4285, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Well executed. Very nice and crisp with great colours. It probably is going down a grade but to me it would have worked even better if you had rotated the image to make the cube van level. One of my top picks. Good luck.</td>', 'Great shot. Well executed. Very nice and crisp with great colours. It probably is going down a grade but to me it would have worked even better if you had rotated the image to make the cube van level. One of my top picks. Good luck.', '2004-03-29 21:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(643245, 66795, 4285, '<td valign="top">Need some kinda big glass to zoom in this close (or are you hanging out the back of a pick-up truck two feet from the action?). Well executed. Good luck.</td>', 'Need some kinda big glass to zoom in this close (or are you hanging out the back of a pick-up truck two feet from the action?). Well executed. Good luck.', '2004-03-29 21:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(643248, 66985, 4285, '<td valign="top">Well executed.</td>', 'Well executed.', '2004-03-29 21:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(643251, 67039, 4285, '<td valign="top">Very creative. How did you mount your camera to the chair? Did you use a high ISO or did you add noise. I''d like this better with less noise. Colours are nice and vivid. One of my top picks. Good luck. :)</td>', 'Very creative. How did you mount your camera to the chair? Did you use a high ISO or did you add noise. I''d like this better with less noise. Colours are nice and vivid. One of my top picks. Good luck. :)', '2004-03-29 21:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
