(643453, 66963, 14986, '<td valign="top">I don''t see too much of a blur effect here.  The eye is drawn right away to the fire/oven and it takes some time to pull out any other detail.  I think the face is blurred, but it''s really hard to tell.</td>', 'I don''t see too much of a blur effect here.  The eye is drawn right away to the fire/oven and it takes some time to pull out any other detail.  I think the face is blurred, but it''s really hard to tell.', '2004-03-30 01:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
