(643522, 66985, 16004, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a nice job here - car is well defined, background suitably motion blurred.  Almost motor magazine quality, but maybe a teeny tiny tad bit over-exposed?  Not sure - job well done anyway - 8.</td>', 'You''ve done a nice job here - car is well defined, background suitably motion blurred.  Almost motor magazine quality, but maybe a teeny tiny tad bit over-exposed?  Not sure - job well done anyway - 8.', '2004-03-30 03:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(643523, 66889, 16004, '<td valign="top">Bird looks like it''s Voguing.  COmposition is pretty good, and the image conveys the movement of the swan very well.  Was it cloudy when you took the picture?  Only it looks a bit dark / dull...  But aside from that I think it fits the challenge nicely.</td>', 'Bird looks like it''s Voguing.  COmposition is pretty good, and the image conveys the movement of the swan very well.  Was it cloudy when you took the picture?  Only it looks a bit dark / dull...  But aside from that I think it fits the challenge nicely.', '2004-03-30 03:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(643524, 66987, 16004, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I can''t really see where it fits the challenge - the aircraft is too well defined, and only the propellor seems to be the only (incidental) source of MB.  If it were cloudy, or there was some sort of skyline visible, I''m sure it would have worked better.  But a clear blue sky, ironically, has hampered your image.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I can''t really see where it fits the challenge - the aircraft is too well defined, and only the propellor seems to be the only (incidental) source of MB.  If it were cloudy, or there was some sort of skyline visible, I''m sure it would have worked better.  But a clear blue sky, ironically, has hampered your image.', '2004-03-30 03:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(643526, 67034, 10170, '<td valign="top">Quite stunning, the green of that butterfly (I assume that''s natural) is astounding.  Meets challenge perfectly, and great pic in general.  10</td>', 'Quite stunning, the green of that butterfly (I assume that''s natural) is astounding.  Meets challenge perfectly, and great pic in general.  10', '2004-03-30 03:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(643527, 67042, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very effective indeed, just the right amount of blur so you see what it is but no detail, and a perfectly crisp background.</td>', 'Very effective indeed, just the right amount of blur so you see what it is but no detail, and a perfectly crisp background.', '2004-03-30 03:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(643528, 66489, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.</td>', 'Very nicely done.', '2004-03-30 03:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(643529, 67116, 10170, '<td valign="top">Clever and very effective, the lighting works really well here.</td>', 'Clever and very effective, the lighting works really well here.', '2004-03-30 03:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(643530, 66151, 16004, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, it does not appear that motion blur is enhancing your shot - a slightly longer exposure / tracking shot might have made the background more swooshy and the wheels less well defined.  And it''s purely personal opinion which has not impact on my voting, but a white Honda isn''t the most photogenic of vehicles.  That aside, I like the composition and I reckon you did a reasonable job on what is a difficult process.  6.</td>', 'Unfortunately, it does not appear that motion blur is enhancing your shot - a slightly longer exposure / tracking shot might have made the background more swooshy and the wheels less well defined.  And it''s purely personal opinion which has not impact on my voting, but a white Honda isn''t the most photogenic of vehicles.  That aside, I like the composition and I reckon you did a reasonable job on what is a difficult process.  6.', '2004-03-30 03:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(643531, 67051, 10170, '<td valign="top">Priceless expression on his/her face.</td>', 'Priceless expression on his/her face.', '2004-03-30 03:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(643532, 67136, 16004, '<td valign="top">I like this one!  I wonder, though, how it might look if you cropped it in such a way that only the flag filled the shot?  It''s only a minor issue, but the background (whatever the orange thing is) is a little distracting.   I do love the movement captured in the top portion of the flag though.</td>', 'I like this one!  I wonder, though, how it might look if you cropped it in such a way that only the flag filled the shot?  It''s only a minor issue, but the background (whatever the orange thing is) is a little distracting.   I do love the movement captured in the top portion of the flag though.', '2004-03-30 03:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(643533, 66899, 10170, '<td valign="top">I like it, but would have preferred it with either the horse/buggy or the background blurre and the other sharp.</td>', 'I like it, but would have preferred it with either the horse/buggy or the background blurre and the other sharp.', '2004-03-30 04:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(643544, 67034, 9982, '<td valign="top">No need to add the bit about not adding blur. Great shot nicely cropped. [8]</td>', 'No need to add the bit about not adding blur. Great shot nicely cropped. [8]', '2004-03-30 05:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(643547, 67050, 16004, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture - certainly one of my favourites of the transport-themed shots.  The car to environment ratio is spot on.  And heavens to Betsy, your chosen car is actually a good choice!  I liked the old CE, and the different greys of the body compliments the snowy location and the sky very well.  And the wheels look really good - exposure time seems spot on.  Good picture - 9.</td>', 'This is a great picture - certainly one of my favourites of the transport-themed shots.  The car to environment ratio is spot on.  And heavens to Betsy, your chosen car is actually a good choice!  I liked the old CE, and the different greys of the body compliments the snowy location and the sky very well.  And the wheels look really good - exposure time seems spot on.  Good picture - 9.', '2004-03-30 05:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(643548, 67003, 16046, '<td valign="top">My top pick, excellent sharp focus, good color.</td>', 'My top pick, excellent sharp focus, good color.', '2004-03-30 06:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(643549, 67082, 16046, '<td valign="top">good job, nice work</td>', 'good job, nice work', '2004-03-30 06:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(643550, 66425, 16046, '<td valign="top">very cool.</td>', 'very cool.', '2004-03-30 06:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(643551, 66984, 16004, '<td valign="top">Great action shot - could see this being a ribbon contender quite easily (or at least it should be).  The bike is particularly photogenic - something about the orange wheels.  Anyway, great shot.  10.</td>', 'Great action shot - could see this being a ribbon contender quite easily (or at least it should be).  The bike is particularly photogenic - something about the orange wheels.  Anyway, great shot.  10.', '2004-03-30 06:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(643553, 67145, 16004, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept this.  If I were in your position I might be tempted to try the same shot without the kid and crop out the cave - the trees, landscaping and sky in the background looks really cool.  At the least I''d reduce the amount of cave visible at the top of the shot as it appears a bit wonky.  I like the picture, it just feels that there''s too many details in it.  6.</td>', 'Interesting concept this.  If I were in your position I might be tempted to try the same shot without the kid and crop out the cave - the trees, landscaping and sky in the background looks really cool.  At the least I''d reduce the amount of cave visible at the top of the shot as it appears a bit wonky.  I like the picture, it just feels that there''s too many details in it.  6.', '2004-03-30 06:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(643555, 67074, 16004, '<td valign="top">Is this a model?  If so, you''re a bloody genius, because I really can''t tell - I only became suspicious because there are bugger all of these cars parked around grassy slopes for people to take pictures of...  Did you try taking pictures of it after someone gave it a push?  Lighting is very stylish, and I think it fits the challenge well enough...  9.</td>', 'Is this a model?  If so, you''re a bloody genius, because I really can''t tell - I only became suspicious because there are bugger all of these cars parked around grassy slopes for people to take pictures of...  Did you try taking pictures of it after someone gave it a push?  Lighting is very stylish, and I think it fits the challenge well enough...  9.', '2004-03-30 06:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(643558, 66942, 4008, '<td valign="top">I think it is a very nice picture, with great light, but I don''t like the motion blur effect here, it doesn''t seem to enhance the picture, it looks like he is rubbing her nose.</td>', 'I think it is a very nice picture, with great light, but I don''t like the motion blur effect here, it doesn''t seem to enhance the picture, it looks like he is rubbing her nose.', '2004-03-30 06:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
