(643589, 66771, 15810, '<td valign="top">Sorry but in my opinion EITHER the subject or the background should be in focus for the motion blur effect to work and not just look like a blurry photo.</td>', 'Sorry but in my opinion EITHER the subject or the background should be in focus for the motion blur effect to work and not just look like a blurry photo.', '2004-03-30 08:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
