(643601, 67177, 12827, '<td valign="top">Color seems unatural.</td>', 'Color seems unatural.', '2004-03-30 08:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(643603, 66676, 15810, '<td valign="top">Brilliant capture.  Very difficult to get right but you have managed very well indeed to grab and portray the flight of the bird. (was it coming in to land, did you not get the splashdown?)</td>', 'Brilliant capture.  Very difficult to get right but you have managed very well indeed to grab and portray the flight of the bird. (was it coming in to land, did you not get the splashdown?)', '2004-03-30 08:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(643604, 67170, 15810, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Well captured and great colour.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Well captured and great colour.', '2004-03-30 08:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(643607, 66962, 15810, '<td valign="top">Brillinat stuff. I really like submissions which are out of the ordinary and this is now one of my favourites of the challenge. Unfortunately i dont think its a crowd pleaser.</td>', 'Brillinat stuff. I really like submissions which are out of the ordinary and this is now one of my favourites of the challenge. Unfortunately i dont think its a crowd pleaser.', '2004-03-30 08:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(643609, 67017, 15810, '<td valign="top">Bizarre. I just dont know what your trying to portray here? Why are the laces moving? Why are they vertical? Is the shoe swinging? It kind of holds my attention because I have idea whats going on or why....lol  Good job.</td>', 'Bizarre. I just dont know what your trying to portray here? Why are the laces moving? Why are they vertical? Is the shoe swinging? It kind of holds my attention because I have idea whats going on or why....lol  Good job.', '2004-03-30 08:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(643610, 67059, 15810, '<td valign="top">Another vehicle shot. I dont really know why but you havent really managed to portray speed if that was your intention. Great crisp focus on the (slow?) moving subject pity the weather want a bit better.</td>', 'Another vehicle shot. I dont really know why but you havent really managed to portray speed if that was your intention. Great crisp focus on the (slow?) moving subject pity the weather want a bit better.', '2004-03-30 08:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(643611, 67134, 15810, '<td valign="top">OK, there''s a blurry thing top right and a streak of light ( I think) on the road in the lower foreground. Searched for a ghost then gave up. Well at least it had me looking at your photo for quite a long time :-)</td>', 'OK, there''s a blurry thing top right and a streak of light ( I think) on the road in the lower foreground. Searched for a ghost then gave up. Well at least it had me looking at your photo for quite a long time :-)', '2004-03-30 08:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(643620, 67134, 16004, '<td valign="top">A bit too Where''s Waldo for me - are you referring to the blur at the top right?  It''s just a bit too incidental to really impact on the picture.  I also thought the foreground is a little too cluttery and detracts from the action and could have been cropped from this end of the pier...   Actually the water, sky and motionless ship are very photogenic and look pretty good.  Tough one to score...</td>', 'A bit too Where''s Waldo for me - are you referring to the blur at the top right?  It''s just a bit too incidental to really impact on the picture.  I also thought the foreground is a little too cluttery and detracts from the action and could have been cropped from this end of the pier...   Actually the water, sky and motionless ship are very photogenic and look pretty good.  Tough one to score...', '2004-03-30 09:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(643621, 67171, 16004, '<td valign="top">Like this one - the black and white I thought works really well.  Could make a decent poster even.  The only slight personal alteration i might have made was to lower the position of the bike - seems a wee bit high...   The bike is so in focus compared to the rest - you must have hands like a rock.  You have definitely captured the spirit of the challenge, so 9 it is.</td>', 'Like this one - the black and white I thought works really well.  Could make a decent poster even.  The only slight personal alteration i might have made was to lower the position of the bike - seems a wee bit high...   The bike is so in focus compared to the rest - you must have hands like a rock.  You have definitely captured the spirit of the challenge, so 9 it is.', '2004-03-30 09:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(643692, 66942, 14614, '<td valign="top">well done, evokes a mood - b&amp;w a good choice, one of my ribbon picks</td>', 'well done, evokes a mood - b&w a good choice, one of my ribbon picks', '2004-03-30 11:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(643696, 67163, 14614, '<td valign="top">really like the motion here - adds to the composition.  looks like you took your time to get the right frams, foreground and background.  One of my ribbon picks.</td>', 'really like the motion here - adds to the composition.  looks like you took your time to get the right frams, foreground and background.  One of my ribbon picks.', '2004-03-30 11:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(643723, 66151, 8522, '<td valign="top">Either a very short shutter speed, or doesn''t appear to be moving very fast.</td>', 'Either a very short shutter speed, or doesn''t appear to be moving very fast.', '2004-03-30 11:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(643730, 67042, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting blur... it looks like a ghost of sorts :)  Less blur would work well here also... = 6</td>', 'Interesting blur... it looks like a ghost of sorts :)  Less blur would work well here also... = 6', '2004-03-30 11:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(643732, 66771, 16850, '<td valign="top">Nice movement and colors.</td>', 'Nice movement and colors.', '2004-03-30 11:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(643735, 66984, 772, '<td valign="top">Great action capture... very nice work :) = 9</td>', 'Great action capture... very nice work :) = 9', '2004-03-30 11:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(643736, 67107, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice work... the subtle motion blur is strong in this photo :) = 8</td>', 'Very nice work... the subtle motion blur is strong in this photo :) = 8', '2004-03-30 11:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(643738, 67119, 16850, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful. The perfect subject for this technique!</td>', 'This is wonderful. The perfect subject for this technique!', '2004-03-30 11:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(643739, 67101, 772, '<td valign="top">Good motion capture... a little more open room at the base would be good in this composition also... = 6</td>', 'Good motion capture... a little more open room at the base would be good in this composition also... = 6', '2004-03-30 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(643742, 67124, 16850, '<td valign="top">Nice concept but the lighting needs to highlight the dirt</td>', 'Nice concept but the lighting needs to highlight the dirt', '2004-03-30 11:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(643744, 67023, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice work.. I love the contrasty nature of this shot and I really appreciate the more subtle motion blur.  excellent shot.. = 10</td>', 'Very nice work.. I love the contrasty nature of this shot and I really appreciate the more subtle motion blur.  excellent shot.. = 10', '2004-03-30 11:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(643747, 67003, 8522, '<td valign="top">Perfect panning technique. Good choice of shutter speed. Shame about the uninspired background. I''d have flipped the photo so the ducks were flying left to right.</td>', 'Perfect panning technique. Good choice of shutter speed. Shame about the uninspired background. I''d have flipped the photo so the ducks were flying left to right.', '2004-03-30 11:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(643749, 67072, 16850, '<td valign="top">Good subject for the technique</td>', 'Good subject for the technique', '2004-03-30 11:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(643750, 67170, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice capture...  I love these large birds and they are fun to watch in action.  This photo could possibly be strengthened by a little wider composition to allow more room for movement in the frame... = 7</td>', 'Nice capture...  I love these large birds and they are fun to watch in action.  This photo could possibly be strengthened by a little wider composition to allow more room for movement in the frame... = 7', '2004-03-30 11:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(643751, 66979, 16850, '<td valign="top">The ball gets a little lost in all the green. I like the dog!</td>', 'The ball gets a little lost in all the green. I like the dog!', '2004-03-30 11:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(643756, 67048, 16850, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect. The open door really anchors it.</td>', 'Very nice effect. The open door really anchors it.', '2004-03-30 11:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(643757, 67072, 6130, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and good. 10</td>', 'Beautiful and good. 10', '2004-03-30 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(643759, 67177, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely.10</td>', 'Lovely.10', '2004-03-30 11:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(643760, 66985, 16850, '<td valign="top">Very nice but a real VW would have the rear end shown (going out of frame)</td>', 'Very nice but a real VW would have the rear end shown (going out of frame)', '2004-03-30 11:35:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(643761, 67163, 6130, '<td valign="top">I love it.10</td>', 'I love it.10', '2004-03-30 11:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(643763, 66970, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like it.</td>', 'I like it.', '2004-03-30 11:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(643764, 67064, 8522, '<td valign="top">I''m stunned by your panning technique here. I can''t get over how crisp your subject is, given the speed of your pan and the shutter speed used. The composition doesn''t quite work for me but it''s a great shot.</td>', 'I''m stunned by your panning technique here. I can''t get over how crisp your subject is, given the speed of your pan and the shutter speed used. The composition doesn''t quite work for me but it''s a great shot.', '2004-03-30 11:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(643765, 66446, 16850, '<td valign="top">Subject is lost</td>', 'Subject is lost', '2004-03-30 11:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(643766, 67107, 6130, '<td valign="top">Funny and good.</td>', 'Funny and good.', '2004-03-30 11:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(643767, 67155, 16850, '<td valign="top">Nice effect</td>', 'Nice effect', '2004-03-30 11:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(643768, 66889, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-03-30 11:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(643771, 66870, 6130, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.</td>', 'Fantastic.', '2004-03-30 11:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(643772, 67180, 16850, '<td valign="top">Too much effect and getting abstract</td>', 'Too much effect and getting abstract', '2004-03-30 11:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(643795, 67016, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, I took a bike pic, and can certainly appreciate the sharpness you''ve captured here. Not quite sure about the composition, I think it would have worked better with a tighter crop. Perhaps tilting the picture so it looks as if he is pedalling more uphill would have added more drama.</td>', 'Wow, I took a bike pic, and can certainly appreciate the sharpness you''ve captured here. Not quite sure about the composition, I think it would have worked better with a tighter crop. Perhaps tilting the picture so it looks as if he is pedalling more uphill would have added more drama.', '2004-03-30 11:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(643802, 66799, 15810, '<td valign="top">really like this. I dont suppose it''s a crowd pleaser but i think the colour, the over exposure  and the crop is excellent. Well done.</td>', 'really like this. I dont suppose it''s a crowd pleaser but i think the colour, the over exposure  and the crop is excellent. Well done.', '2004-03-30 11:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(643805, 66934, 7743, '<td valign="top">I''d say this the affect of too much caffeine.  Interesting take on the challenge.</td>', 'I''d say this the affect of too much caffeine.  Interesting take on the challenge.', '2004-03-30 11:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(643816, 67168, 772, '<td valign="top">I like this... It feels like I''m drunk and watching a rodeo :) = 7</td>', 'I like this... It feels like I''m drunk and watching a rodeo :) = 7', '2004-03-30 12:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(643829, 66988, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.. the background color in this photo could possibly be more supportive of the theme... = 5</td>', 'Interesting idea.. the background color in this photo could possibly be more supportive of the theme... = 5', '2004-03-30 12:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(643830, 66242, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like the bubbles idea. Its good focus. But, It seems too noisy to me and the colors seem unnatural.</td>', 'I like the bubbles idea. Its good focus. But, It seems too noisy to me and the colors seem unnatural.', '2004-03-30 12:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(643834, 66289, 9668, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, seems too abstract though.</td>', 'Interesting idea, seems too abstract though.', '2004-03-30 12:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(643838, 67089, 9668, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, it would be awsome had the cars been in focus. Also the white bar on the top is distracting. I like dueling idea.</td>', 'Cool idea, it would be awsome had the cars been in focus. Also the white bar on the top is distracting. I like dueling idea.', '2004-03-30 12:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(643846, 67180, 9668, '<td valign="top">Seems too abstract. I like how the motion blue lines curve towards him. NIce racing idea.</td>', 'Seems too abstract. I like how the motion blue lines curve towards him. NIce racing idea.', '2004-03-30 12:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(643848, 66969, 9668, '<td valign="top">Great capture! Good focus, and lighting. The only thing that bothers me is the yellow streak coming from the hatch on the top.</td>', 'Great capture! Good focus, and lighting. The only thing that bothers me is the yellow streak coming from the hatch on the top.', '2004-03-30 12:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(643851, 66151, 3102, '<td valign="top">To be brutally honest... it''s just not interesting... :(</td>', 'To be brutally honest... it''s just not interesting... :(', '2004-03-30 12:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(643852, 66827, 9668, '<td valign="top">Sorry, seems too abstract. No real subject. Is pretty original though.</td>', 'Sorry, seems too abstract. No real subject. Is pretty original though.', '2004-03-30 12:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(643858, 67017, 9668, '<td valign="top">Could you not think of a title for this?<br/>I like the black/white contrast. Excellent blur. I like how it seems to glow. I would like a little more space at the bottom of the frame.</td>', 'Could you not think of a title for this?I like the black/white contrast. Excellent blur. I like how it seems to glow. I would like a little more space at the bottom of the frame.', '2004-03-30 12:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
