(643943, 66449, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  I love the high key nature of it.  The title seems to contradict the photo in some ways though.  When I think of spring, I obviously think of colors in the environment.  I still like the shot though :) = 10</td>', 'This is a great shot.  I love the high key nature of it.  The title seems to contradict the photo in some ways though.  When I think of spring, I obviously think of colors in the environment.  I still like the shot though :) = 10', '2004-03-30 13:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(643952, 67064, 18485, '<td valign="top">my top score.  this is great.  perfect realization of the challenge (the image in enhanced by the motion effect, and then some!).  wonderful catch.</td>', 'my top score.  this is great.  perfect realization of the challenge (the image in enhanced by the motion effect, and then some!).  wonderful catch.', '2004-03-30 13:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(643953, 67047, 18485, '<td valign="top">she''s great, the hair is great.  the background is distracting.</td>', 'she''s great, the hair is great.  the background is distracting.', '2004-03-30 13:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(643954, 67165, 18485, '<td valign="top">nice capture.  the color/lighting is a bit dull.  the motion blur is great.</td>', 'nice capture.  the color/lighting is a bit dull.  the motion blur is great.', '2004-03-30 13:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(643956, 67138, 18485, '<td valign="top">nice capture.  the color of the train is a real plus.  i think the lighting is a bit dull (you can''t plan the weather!) but the overall shot and realization of the challenge are excellent.</td>', 'nice capture.  the color of the train is a real plus.  i think the lighting is a bit dull (you can''t plan the weather!) but the overall shot and realization of the challenge are excellent.', '2004-03-30 13:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(643957, 67163, 18485, '<td valign="top">hahaha.  this is really fun.  i hope the landing was soft!!   your horizon is a bit tilted (this is a distraction that tends to bug me more than others) but the motion blur is nice.  might have been enhanced more if you had caught one body part still (unrealistic but worth a mention).  great shot.</td>', 'hahaha.  this is really fun.  i hope the landing was soft!!   your horizon is a bit tilted (this is a distraction that tends to bug me more than others) but the motion blur is nice.  might have been enhanced more if you had caught one body part still (unrealistic but worth a mention).  great shot.', '2004-03-30 13:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(643958, 67034, 18485, '<td valign="top">nice butterfly, great isolated motion blur.  the flowers are a bit overexposed but otherwise, nice shot.</td>', 'nice butterfly, great isolated motion blur.  the flowers are a bit overexposed but otherwise, nice shot.', '2004-03-30 13:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(643959, 67141, 18485, '<td valign="top">very moody and atmospheric.  no true focal point here but a nice soft and unusual realization of the challenge.</td>', 'very moody and atmospheric.  no true focal point here but a nice soft and unusual realization of the challenge.', '2004-03-30 13:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(643960, 67179, 18485, '<td valign="top">sweet!  i''d love it more if there weren t the blue cast to the can.  great capture. how many outtakes??</td>', 'sweet!  i''d love it more if there weren t the blue cast to the can.  great capture. how many outtakes??', '2004-03-30 13:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(643962, 67023, 18485, '<td valign="top">nicely done.  i love the subtlety of this entry.  the b/w is a good choice and the graininess (intentional?) gives it a photojournalistic feel.  good job.</td>', 'nicely done.  i love the subtlety of this entry.  the b/w is a good choice and the graininess (intentional?) gives it a photojournalistic feel.  good job.', '2004-03-30 13:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
