(644150, 66914, 11570, '<td valign="top">Nice macro of a beetle but it does not suggest much motion blur to me.</td>', 'Nice macro of a beetle but it does not suggest much motion blur to me.', '2004-03-30 16:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(644151, 67163, 11570, '<td valign="top">A classic type of shot well executed 7</td>', 'A classic type of shot well executed 7', '2004-03-30 16:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(644154, 67161, 11570, '<td valign="top">Great motion blur interpretation with the cyclits going opposite ways but for me the lack of any point of sharp focus on the nearer non-motion blurred rider reduces the the potentila for a wow factor 7</td>', 'Great motion blur interpretation with the cyclits going opposite ways but for me the lack of any point of sharp focus on the nearer non-motion blurred rider reduces the the potentila for a wow factor 7', '2004-03-30 16:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(644155, 67039, 8286, '<td valign="top">This seems like a photoshop effect rather than a motion blur study.</td>', 'This seems like a photoshop effect rather than a motion blur study.', '2004-03-30 16:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(644158, 67156, 18709, '<td valign="top">An interesting contrast.  I''m not sure if it comes off completely, but I rather like it.</td>', 'An interesting contrast.  I''m not sure if it comes off completely, but I rather like it.', '2004-03-30 16:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(644162, 67133, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is very good.  The circular action is very clear. This is quite a contraption. I don''t think I''ve ever seen one.  I am of course imagining what it looks like when still.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-05 04:43:18.</i></td>', 'This is very good.  The circular action is very clear. This is quite a contraption. I don''t think I''ve ever seen one.  I am of course imagining what it looks like when still.', '2004-03-30 16:43:18.000000', '2004-04-05 05:43:18.000000', 1),
(644163, 67072, 18709, '<td valign="top">I think you have caught the mood of this very well indeed.  the circular movemenht of the right arm is exactly right.</td>', 'I think you have caught the mood of this very well indeed.  the circular movemenht of the right arm is exactly right.', '2004-03-30 16:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(644167, 67059, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is good.  The wetness gives it a chilly feel.</td>', 'This is good.  The wetness gives it a chilly feel.', '2004-03-30 16:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(644168, 66882, 18709, '<td valign="top">It looks as if the female is chasing the male.  So what else is new?   Just enough land and just enough water.  Very well balanced.</td>', 'It looks as if the female is chasing the male.  So what else is new?   Just enough land and just enough water.  Very well balanced.', '2004-03-30 16:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(644172, 66889, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is nicely caught, with just the head in focus abnd everything else about the bird is blurred.  Also the water descending .</td>', 'This is nicely caught, with just the head in focus abnd everything else about the bird is blurred.  Also the water descending .', '2004-03-30 16:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(644177, 67155, 18709, '<td valign="top">A very ingenious shot.   I like this.</td>', 'A very ingenious shot.   I like this.', '2004-03-30 16:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(644208, 66953, 14608, '<td valign="top">It''s look like you have problem with yours sofware , picture are all with cubic frame. Nice shot.</td>', 'It''s look like you have problem with yours sofware , picture are all with cubic frame. Nice shot.', '2004-03-30 17:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(644223, 66425, 7908, '<td valign="top">There are a number of zooming shots in the challenge, but this is the only one (so far) that is really working for me. I think it''s the subject ... neon lights can be a little disorienting, so it''s not as unnatural to see this effect with them, I think. Great job! 8</td>', 'There are a number of zooming shots in the challenge, but this is the only one (so far) that is really working for me. I think it''s the subject ... neon lights can be a little disorienting, so it''s not as unnatural to see this effect with them, I think. Great job! 8', '2004-03-30 17:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(644229, 67023, 7908, '<td valign="top">Great choice of subject. Some entries are subjects in motion just for the sake of the motion, as opposed to subjects that are enhanced by motion. I have always been amazed by the speed of a string musician''s hands, and so capturing this motion really accentuates that. Very nice!</td>', 'Great choice of subject. Some entries are subjects in motion just for the sake of the motion, as opposed to subjects that are enhanced by motion. I have always been amazed by the speed of a string musician''s hands, and so capturing this motion really accentuates that. Very nice!', '2004-03-30 17:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(644233, 66979, 7908, '<td valign="top">Great timing to catch his anticipation! A cleaner background would really help here, I think.</td>', 'Great timing to catch his anticipation! A cleaner background would really help here, I think.', '2004-03-30 17:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(644236, 67134, 7908, '<td valign="top">There''s so much in this scene that isn''t moving, that it took me a minute to find the motion. It''s a nice long exposure in low light, but it doesn''t really accentuate the motion all that much.</td>', 'There''s so much in this scene that isn''t moving, that it took me a minute to find the motion. It''s a nice long exposure in low light, but it doesn''t really accentuate the motion all that much.', '2004-03-30 18:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(644242, 67179, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nicely done..very crisp and clear.</td>', 'Nicely done..very crisp and clear.', '2004-03-30 18:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(644248, 66996, 14603, '<td valign="top">You can really sense the movement in this image..well captured</td>', 'You can really sense the movement in this image..well captured', '2004-03-30 18:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(644251, 66942, 14603, '<td valign="top">Well composed and beautifully lit.<br/>Nice piece of work</td>', 'Well composed and beautifully lit.Nice piece of work', '2004-03-30 18:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(644257, 67112, 14603, '<td valign="top">Just a pity this image wasn`t larger as it is beautifully captured.<br/></td>', 'Just a pity this image wasn`t larger as it is beautifully captured.', '2004-03-30 18:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(644259, 66889, 14603, '<td valign="top">great capture</td>', 'great capture', '2004-03-30 18:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(644280, 66970, 14603, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and lighting in this image..one of my favourites so far</td>', 'Love the colours and lighting in this image..one of my favourites so far', '2004-03-30 18:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(644343, 67049, 9668, '<td valign="top">I wanted to do a water motion blur, and did. I didn''t know if it would qualify enough for motion blur in people''s minds. I really like this shot. You have a great composition, good color, sharp focus. I believe that this is an ok motion blur because it is "long exposure." I like the little rock statue in front of it. I have built and photographed statues like that. Awsome shot!</td>', 'I wanted to do a water motion blur, and did. I didn''t know if it would qualify enough for motion blur in people''s minds. I really like this shot. You have a great composition, good color, sharp focus. I believe that this is an ok motion blur because it is "long exposure." I like the little rock statue in front of it. I have built and photographed statues like that. Awsome shot!', '2004-03-30 19:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(644344, 66771, 9668, '<td valign="top">Too blurry. Good subject, but some part of the shot should be in focus.</td>', 'Too blurry. Good subject, but some part of the shot should be in focus.', '2004-03-30 19:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(644378, 67042, 9763, '<td valign="top">Movement is good, but maybe a 45 shutter so you can see movement, but still make out the person''s face.</td>', 'Movement is good, but maybe a 45 shutter so you can see movement, but still make out the person''s face.', '2004-03-30 20:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(644379, 67016, 9763, '<td valign="top">Perfect panning.  Great job!  Even great at capturing the shadow clearly!</td>', 'Perfect panning.  Great job!  Even great at capturing the shadow clearly!', '2004-03-30 20:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(644380, 67034, 9763, '<td valign="top">The flowers are a bit too high contrast, but the photo is really nice.  I would have cropped vertically I think</td>', 'The flowers are a bit too high contrast, but the photo is really nice.  I would have cropped vertically I think', '2004-03-30 20:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(644381, 67133, 9763, '<td valign="top">This would have been a perfect 10 if the bottom wasn''t cropped off!</td>', 'This would have been a perfect 10 if the bottom wasn''t cropped off!', '2004-03-30 20:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(644382, 67169, 9763, '<td valign="top">I love the color, but dont'' care for the cropping.  Show the entire flower next time, with the stem.</td>', 'I love the color, but dont'' care for the cropping.  Show the entire flower next time, with the stem.', '2004-03-30 20:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(644383, 66676, 9763, '<td valign="top">Amazing job panning!  You get dizzy just looking at this photo!  Great job!</td>', 'Amazing job panning!  You get dizzy just looking at this photo!  Great job!', '2004-03-30 20:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(644389, 67018, 9452, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, i can see motion but without blur, (ok, i know they alredy told you).</td>', 'Nice capture, i can see motion but without blur, (ok, i know they alredy told you).', '2004-03-30 20:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(644390, 67133, 9452, '<td valign="top">Excellent! this is what i was expecting to see in this challenge. 9 here.</td>', 'Excellent! this is what i was expecting to see in this challenge. 9 here.', '2004-03-30 20:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(644462, 67116, 19130, '<td valign="top">I spent a while looking at this photograph thinking about dismemberment &amp; chaos. It''s something motion does to me on a subconsious level I guess. Well done!</td>', 'I spent a while looking at this photograph thinking about dismemberment & chaos. It''s something motion does to me on a subconsious level I guess. Well done!', '2004-03-30 21:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(644487, 67074, 15029, '<td valign="top">the green is a little distracting. I''m also not sure about cutting off the bottom of the tires, but I guess you didn''t want the curb in the shot, however, it is advanced edditing, so if that is the case, I would have cloned the curb out. That''s just my guess.</td>', 'the green is a little distracting. I''m also not sure about cutting off the bottom of the tires, but I guess you didn''t want the curb in the shot, however, it is advanced edditing, so if that is the case, I would have cloned the curb out. That''s just my guess.', '2004-03-30 22:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
