(652845, 66690, 5822, '<td valign="top">The curved lines are the most interesting aspect to this photo, but there is alot of noise and the blurred effects are minimal and not connected to where the real action should be- towards where the lines converge.</td>', 'The curved lines are the most interesting aspect to this photo, but there is alot of noise and the blurred effects are minimal and not connected to where the real action should be- towards where the lines converge.', '2004-04-04 12:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(652846, 67145, 5822, '<td valign="top">I really like the blurred effect from zooming in here, especially with the frame of the window adding more impact, imo. The background looks pretty neat too.  I only wish the boy''s face was in better focus.  Good job.</td>', 'I really like the blurred effect from zooming in here, especially with the frame of the window adding more impact, imo. The background looks pretty neat too.  I only wish the boy''s face was in better focus.  Good job.', '2004-04-04 12:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(652850, 66242, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very neat concept and I like the colors too. This must have been very difficult to pull off, and must have taken you a gazillion tries. I like the abstract quality this image has and the way the bubble on the right is in relative focus.  Only thing is it looks a bit too noisy.  Still, well done.</td>', 'Very neat concept and I like the colors too. This must have been very difficult to pull off, and must have taken you a gazillion tries. I like the abstract quality this image has and the way the bubble on the right is in relative focus.  Only thing is it looks a bit too noisy.  Still, well done.', '2004-04-04 12:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(652854, 67177, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the composition with the pinwheel set against the sky and the clouds as a contrast.  Good composition and blurred effect.  I like the color, but they appear overly saturated to my eyes.  Still, good job.</td>', 'I like the composition with the pinwheel set against the sky and the clouds as a contrast.  Good composition and blurred effect.  I like the color, but they appear overly saturated to my eyes.  Still, good job.', '2004-04-04 12:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(652855, 67162, 5822, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a remarkable job on keeping the background in very good focus while blurring the subject.  Nice job.</td>', 'You''ve done a remarkable job on keeping the background in very good focus while blurring the subject.  Nice job.', '2004-04-04 12:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(652857, 66446, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the eerie effect you''ve gotten with this lighting.</td>', 'I like the eerie effect you''ve gotten with this lighting.', '2004-04-04 12:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
