(653247, 67138, 5822, '<td valign="top">Good job on the blur, but I think exposure needs some adjustment. Sky is blown out and you''ve lost detail in the shadowed bridge.</td>', 'Good job on the blur, but I think exposure needs some adjustment. Sky is blown out and you''ve lost detail in the shadowed bridge.', '2004-04-04 18:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
