(653258, 67172, 5822, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like the "J" shaped squigglies at the top of the frame, but I have to tell you that I LOVE the rest of the image with it''s very surrealistic, futuristic and eerie look.  This is an awesome picture that I assume took form in post editing? The colors and feel is just great. Can''t wait to see the details after the competition is over.  High score given.</td>', 'I really don''t like the "J" shaped squigglies at the top of the frame, but I have to tell you that I LOVE the rest of the image with it''s very surrealistic, futuristic and eerie look.  This is an awesome picture that I assume took form in post editing? The colors and feel is just great. Can''t wait to see the details after the competition is over.  High score given.', '2004-04-04 18:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(653259, 66927, 5822, '<td valign="top">Really nice color and blur looks good too.  I think you can crop some of the bottom to give more prominence to the butterfly, which should be your main subject.  Well done.</td>', 'Really nice color and blur looks good too.  I think you can crop some of the bottom to give more prominence to the butterfly, which should be your main subject.  Well done.', '2004-04-04 18:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(653263, 67064, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice blur and I like the way "Air Jordon''s" face is in sharp focus. Color is also very good.  A narrower DOF so that only the foreground players were visible would have made this into an awesome picture. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice blur and I like the way "Air Jordon''s" face is in sharp focus. Color is also very good.  A narrower DOF so that only the foreground players were visible would have made this into an awesome picture. Well done.', '2004-04-04 18:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(653269, 66984, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great job panning and nice color too. Portrait format is also appropo showing the height of this stunt.  Well done.</td>', 'Great job panning and nice color too. Portrait format is also appropo showing the height of this stunt.  Well done.', '2004-04-04 19:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(653282, 67062, 5822, '<td valign="top">Despite the blown out sky/sea in the background, this image has a quality that is very appealing.  It reminds me of a Cartier-Bresson photo.  Many people may say that the figure should be positioned facing inwards so that there is more space between him and the frame, but I like his positioning as he is seperated from the black object in the background.  Good job on the blur as well. High score.</td>', 'Despite the blown out sky/sea in the background, this image has a quality that is very appealing.  It reminds me of a Cartier-Bresson photo.  Many people may say that the figure should be positioned facing inwards so that there is more space between him and the frame, but I like his positioning as he is seperated from the black object in the background.  Good job on the blur as well. High score.', '2004-04-04 19:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(653286, 67059, 5822, '<td valign="top">Good job on the color, clarity and blur. Composition is a little static.</td>', 'Good job on the color, clarity and blur. Composition is a little static.', '2004-04-04 19:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(653290, 67107, 5822, '<td valign="top">I think this image could have more impact by zooming in on your subject on the bicycle and including fewer background people in the pic.  That would also have the effect of making the blur more prominent.  Colors could use some more saturation as well.</td>', 'I think this image could have more impact by zooming in on your subject on the bicycle and including fewer background people in the pic.  That would also have the effect of making the blur more prominent.  Colors could use some more saturation as well.', '2004-04-04 19:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(653297, 66795, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great shooting angle and the blur came out very good too.  I also like the crop and rotation of the image within the frame. I think it could use a color balance though. Well done.</td>', 'Great shooting angle and the blur came out very good too.  I also like the crop and rotation of the image within the frame. I think it could use a color balance though. Well done.', '2004-04-04 19:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(653336, 67172, 1031, '<td valign="top">At least on my monitor I find the brightest lights to be a little too bright, and take away from the overall mood.</td>', 'At least on my monitor I find the brightest lights to be a little too bright, and take away from the overall mood.', '2004-04-04 21:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(653348, 66425, 8860, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a BetterPhoto!! ;)</td>', 'Now that''s a BetterPhoto!! ;)', '2004-04-04 21:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(653365, 66923, 7151, '<td valign="top">I think you mean vertigo.  You know what would have been really cool (though pretty tough) would have been to rotate the camera as you moved in.  That would have really fit with the classic sensation of vertigo.  But, that aside, this is a very well executed shot.  I think a little more negative space at the top (or maybe less negative space, by a tighter crop) might have made the composition a little more interesting.</td>', 'I think you mean vertigo.  You know what would have been really cool (though pretty tough) would have been to rotate the camera as you moved in.  That would have really fit with the classic sensation of vertigo.  But, that aside, this is a very well executed shot.  I think a little more negative space at the top (or maybe less negative space, by a tighter crop) might have made the composition a little more interesting.', '2004-04-04 21:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(653367, 67145, 11738, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  That is freaky.  Almost gives me motion sickness just looking at it.  Good job.  Did you use a fill flash?</td>', 'Whoa!  That is freaky.  Almost gives me motion sickness just looking at it.  Good job.  Did you use a fill flash?', '2004-04-04 21:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(653370, 67119, 11738, '<td valign="top">I would have gone for a tighter crop in portrait format.  It would have focussed more attention on the skipper rather than the background.</td>', 'I would have gone for a tighter crop in portrait format.  It would have focussed more attention on the skipper rather than the background.', '2004-04-04 22:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(653373, 67031, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  Love the tilted angle and the crop.  B&amp;W gives it character too.</td>', 'Nice capture.  Love the tilted angle and the crop.  B&W gives it character too.', '2004-04-04 22:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(653375, 67016, 12160, '<td valign="top">great motion shot. sharp focus. 10</td>', 'great motion shot. sharp focus. 10', '2004-04-04 22:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(653376, 67074, 12160, '<td valign="top">This would look more realistic if there was a driver. 6</td>', 'This would look more realistic if there was a driver. 6', '2004-04-04 22:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(653378, 67074, 11738, '<td valign="top">Why aren''t the wheels in motion and where is the driver?  Must be a die cast model...</td>', 'Why aren''t the wheels in motion and where is the driver?  Must be a die cast model...', '2004-04-04 22:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(653379, 67042, 7151, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  With that background, makes it look like some medieval fairae tale wood nymph or something.  Very "mystical".  While I don''t like most of the shots where the blur makes the subject unidentifiable, in this case it works for me.</td>', 'Interesting.  With that background, makes it look like some medieval fairae tale wood nymph or something.  Very "mystical".  While I don''t like most of the shots where the blur makes the subject unidentifiable, in this case it works for me.', '2004-04-04 22:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(653380, 67143, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  Good capture.</td>', 'Nice job.  Good capture.', '2004-04-04 22:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(653382, 67034, 11738, '<td valign="top">The flowers are overexposed, but the focus on the butterfly is bang on.  Good job.</td>', 'The flowers are overexposed, but the focus on the butterfly is bang on.  Good job.', '2004-04-04 22:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(653387, 66970, 11738, '<td valign="top">Cool effect.  Has a very "artsy" feel.  Almost looks like an oil painting.  By far one of my favourites.  I''ll be very disapointed if you don''t finish top-10.</td>', 'Cool effect.  Has a very "artsy" feel.  Almost looks like an oil painting.  By far one of my favourites.  I''ll be very disapointed if you don''t finish top-10.', '2004-04-04 22:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(653389, 67180, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and awesome colours.  One of my favs.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice capture and awesome colours.  One of my favs.  Good luck.', '2004-04-04 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(653395, 67176, 11738, '<td valign="top">sweet light streams.  Good idea and capture.  My only regret is the crappy lighting on the seat backs and on the driver, but hey, it''s inside a car, so what can you do, huh?  Good luck.</td>', 'sweet light streams.  Good idea and capture.  My only regret is the crappy lighting on the seat backs and on the driver, but hey, it''s inside a car, so what can you do, huh?  Good luck.', '2004-04-04 22:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(653399, 66449, 11738, '<td valign="top">Cool high key image.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Cool high key image.  Nicely done.', '2004-04-04 22:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(653403, 67042, 11738, '<td valign="top">Very freaky.  She looks like a ghost or a forest sprite.  I like this image very much, but there''s something about the crop that bothers me, although I can''t seem to figure out how to improve it.  Good work.</td>', 'Very freaky.  She looks like a ghost or a forest sprite.  I like this image very much, but there''s something about the crop that bothers me, although I can''t seem to figure out how to improve it.  Good work.', '2004-04-04 22:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(653405, 67027, 11738, '<td valign="top">Very cool how the bright yellow stands out in this image.</td>', 'Very cool how the bright yellow stands out in this image.', '2004-04-04 22:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(653406, 67048, 11738, '<td valign="top">Crop could have ben better... trim off the right.  This is a good example where that open door should be smack in the middle of the image.</td>', 'Crop could have ben better... trim off the right.  This is a good example where that open door should be smack in the middle of the image.', '2004-04-04 22:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(653436, 67034, 5822, '<td valign="top">Stunning capture, excellent composition and iridescent color. Only weaknesses I see are the blown out white flowers and maybe could use some more space at the bottom, but those are minor. Very well done.</td>', 'Stunning capture, excellent composition and iridescent color. Only weaknesses I see are the blown out white flowers and maybe could use some more space at the bottom, but those are minor. Very well done.', '2004-04-04 23:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(653466, 66914, 7339, '<td valign="top">This is top three. Very creative shot, tiltle. Im giving it an 8. Only thing I found a bit distracting was the blown out spot on its back but i have the same problem some times so it still deserves an 8.  Good job.</td>', 'This is top three. Very creative shot, tiltle. Im giving it an 8. Only thing I found a bit distracting was the blown out spot on its back but i have the same problem some times so it still deserves an 8.  Good job.', '2004-04-04 23:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(653472, 67179, 7339, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Nice color blur and lighting. Everything is sharp where it should be and the lighting is pretty clean. 1 tiny flash mark other catches my eye a bit but over all still looks like a top 3 to me. Great job 8</td>', 'Very nice. Nice color blur and lighting. Everything is sharp where it should be and the lighting is pretty clean. 1 tiny flash mark other catches my eye a bit but over all still looks like a top 3 to me. Great job 8', '2004-04-04 23:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(653478, 67117, 16301, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful image, great composition and motion. 10</td>', 'Very beautiful image, great composition and motion. 10', '2004-04-04 23:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(653479, 66979, 7339, '<td valign="top">I don''t normally go for the pet shots. However this isn''t one of the normal ones we see. Excellent Capture. And probably top 3. I love the dogs intense look of concentration. Only thing that kept me from giving this a 9 was his right front paw got chopped. And I may have cropped the width a bit tighter but that''s just preference. I still  gave it an 8. Nice shot.</td>', 'I don''t normally go for the pet shots. However this isn''t one of the normal ones we see. Excellent Capture. And probably top 3. I love the dogs intense look of concentration. Only thing that kept me from giving this a 9 was his right front paw got chopped. And I may have cropped the width a bit tighter but that''s just preference. I still  gave it an 8. Nice shot.', '2004-04-04 23:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(653482, 66925, 16301, '<td valign="top">Great clarity and motion. I like the close up/composition. B&amp;W works really well with it. 10</td>', 'Great clarity and motion. I like the close up/composition. B&W works really well with it. 10', '2004-04-04 23:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(653485, 66927, 16301, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture and motion.  I like the composition and DOF. 10</td>', 'Beautiful capture and motion.  I like the composition and DOF. 10', '2004-04-04 23:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(653487, 67112, 16301, '<td valign="top">You could have searched the forum for tips on how to resize. This is a well executed image, I love the sense of motion displayed. I was kind and gave you a 10 because its a great photo although its small.<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'You could have searched the forum for tips on how to resize. This is a well executed image, I love the sense of motion displayed. I was kind and gave you a 10 because its a great photo although its small. Good luck...', '2004-04-04 23:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(653490, 67133, 16301, '<td valign="top">Very well executed, great lighting and clarity. I like the sense of motion displayed. 10</td>', 'Very well executed, great lighting and clarity. I like the sense of motion displayed. 10', '2004-04-04 23:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(653492, 66984, 16301, '<td valign="top">Excellent display of motion, great clarity too. 10</td>', 'Excellent display of motion, great clarity too. 10', '2004-04-04 23:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(653497, 66795, 16301, '<td valign="top">Very well executed, dynamic and shows a lot of motion. I love the angle and perspective, very unique. You don''t have to mention that there was no editing though. 10</td>', 'Very well executed, dynamic and shows a lot of motion. I love the angle and perspective, very unique. You don''t have to mention that there was no editing though. 10', '2004-04-04 23:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(653499, 66969, 16301, '<td valign="top">Great clarity and display of motion. Nice background too. 10</td>', 'Great clarity and display of motion. Nice background too. 10', '2004-04-05 00:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(653500, 66889, 14952, '<td valign="top">beautiful image.  I really like the water spray.  The border is a bit strong for my preferences though</td>', 'beautiful image.  I really like the water spray.  The border is a bit strong for my preferences though', '2004-04-05 00:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(653501, 67171, 16301, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and display of motion. I love the B&amp;W here, it works really well. 10</td>', 'Excellent composition and display of motion. I love the B&W here, it works really well. 10', '2004-04-05 00:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(653502, 66889, 16301, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture and sense of motion. Great clarity and composition too. 10</td>', 'Beautiful capture and sense of motion. Great clarity and composition too. 10', '2004-04-05 00:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(653505, 66966, 14952, '<td valign="top">This is a great panning image.  I think it could have been improved if the back of the truck was included and if the truck top was parallel to the top of the image instead of slanting.</td>', 'This is a great panning image.  I think it could have been improved if the back of the truck was included and if the truck top was parallel to the top of the image instead of slanting.', '2004-04-05 00:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(653506, 67042, 13897, '<td valign="top">Excellent job. Great choice on the pink clothing too. It really makes the shot.</td>', 'Excellent job. Great choice on the pink clothing too. It really makes the shot.', '2004-04-05 00:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(653511, 67040, 12253, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it says as a statement, but technically this is very impressive.  I hope you have indicated in your notes how you did this, because that''t the first place I am going to visit after the challenge!</td>', 'I don''t know what it says as a statement, but technically this is very impressive.  I hope you have indicated in your notes how you did this, because that''t the first place I am going to visit after the challenge!', '2004-04-05 00:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(653515, 66669, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good panning stop motion; I think it might have been a bit better with 1) a slower shutter speed so there was more pan, and 2) a better vantage point without the bleachers in the background, if possible.</td>', 'Good panning stop motion; I think it might have been a bit better with 1) a slower shutter speed so there was more pan, and 2) a better vantage point without the bleachers in the background, if possible.', '2004-04-05 00:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(653518, 67031, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent panning!  Perfect top motion on the girl, even a good expression.  As to leaving the tilt in, it might add to the overall aesthetics, but the viewer has to get past seeing the houses which clearly show this is camera tilt rather than going down a hill.<br/> <br/>In any case, I really like the shot, and the joyful expression she has, which with the motion makes this a joyful shot.</td>', 'Excellent panning!  Perfect top motion on the girl, even a good expression.  As to leaving the tilt in, it might add to the overall aesthetics, but the viewer has to get past seeing the houses which clearly show this is camera tilt rather than going down a hill. In any case, I really like the shot, and the joyful expression she has, which with the motion makes this a joyful shot.', '2004-04-05 00:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(653570, 66449, 13336, '<td valign="top">beautiful use of high key!  this site doesn''t normally tolerate any kind of over-exposure, but i think people would have to be daft not to see this as anything other than extraordinary.  great photo, vivid emotion, innocent and fun, interesting composition.  good luck!</td>', 'beautiful use of high key!  this site doesn''t normally tolerate any kind of over-exposure, but i think people would have to be daft not to see this as anything other than extraordinary.  great photo, vivid emotion, innocent and fun, interesting composition.  good luck!', '2004-04-05 00:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(653572, 67124, 13336, '<td valign="top">i hate to state the obvious, but where''s the wind?<br/> <br/>don''t mind me, just being silly...</td>', 'i hate to state the obvious, but where''s the wind? don''t mind me, just being silly...', '2004-04-05 00:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(653576, 67051, 12160, '<td valign="top">Great pic, love the motion.... funny face too. ::-) 7</td>', 'Great pic, love the motion.... funny face too. ::-) 7', '2004-04-05 00:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(653586, 66984, 1280, '<td valign="top">Great job, congrats!</td>', 'Great job, congrats!', '2004-04-05 01:01:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(653588, 67133, 1280, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  Terrific job!</td>', 'Congrats!  Terrific job!', '2004-04-05 01:02:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(653589, 67016, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very good!  Congrats!!!</td>', 'Very good!  Congrats!!!', '2004-04-05 01:03:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(653590, 66970, 12962, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your great comments and encouragement.  This challenge has been a real joy ride, I mean, roller coaster ride, (especially after the April fool''s joke) (and top ten is not bad at all).  Thanks again!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-05 00:36:24.</i></td>', 'Thank you all for your great comments and encouragement.  This challenge has been a real joy ride, I mean, roller coaster ride, (especially after the April fool''s joke) (and top ten is not bad at all).  Thanks again!', '2004-04-05 01:03:49.000000', '2004-04-05 01:36:24.000000', 0),
(653598, 67064, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice job Terry.  I didn''t get the time to comment during the challenge, but you met the challenge well. Knew this pic would be near the top.<br/> <br/>Regards,<br/> <br/>Grayce</td>', 'Nice job Terry.  I didn''t get the time to comment during the challenge, but you met the challenge well. Knew this pic would be near the top. Regards, Grayce', '2004-04-05 01:08:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(653600, 67133, 12962, '<td valign="top">Congratulations.  Really beautiful and provocative photograph!</td>', 'Congratulations.  Really beautiful and provocative photograph!', '2004-04-05 01:08:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(653622, 67082, 16499, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the comments and marks (good and bad :-)))<br/> <br/>For the Critique Club I just wanted to mention that this is done with no advanced editing, no effects applied and in fact, no special setup - I had some firewood to chop for my fireplace :-)))</td>', 'Thanks everyone for the comments and marks (good and bad :-))) For the Critique Club I just wanted to mention that this is done with no advanced editing, no effects applied and in fact, no special setup - I had some firewood to chop for my fireplace :-)))', '2004-04-05 01:23:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(653624, 66970, 15207, '<td valign="top">I thought for sure you''d get a ribbon. Beautiful image! Congrats on 6th!</td>', 'I thought for sure you''d get a ribbon. Beautiful image! Congrats on 6th!', '2004-04-05 01:24:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(653628, 66449, 13336, '<td valign="top">happy to say i''m one of the few to see this as a 10.  i knew this wouldn''t take a ribbon on this site, but i''m still disapointed to see where you ended up.  you do some nice post work - thanks for the explanation.<br/> <br/>in the real world i think a photo like this would wow most people, but around here there is such a trend set so firmly in place about what we are allowed and not allowed to like... don''t let the lower scores  get you down.  this is a 10, all the way.  great work!</td>', 'happy to say i''m one of the few to see this as a 10.  i knew this wouldn''t take a ribbon on this site, but i''m still disapointed to see where you ended up.  you do some nice post work - thanks for the explanation. in the real world i think a photo like this would wow most people, but around here there is such a trend set so firmly in place about what we are allowed and not allowed to like... don''t let the lower scores  get you down.  this is a 10, all the way.  great work!', '2004-04-05 01:26:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(653629, 67016, 15207, '<td valign="top">Great shot! So crisp and well-shot. Congrats!</td>', 'Great shot! So crisp and well-shot. Congrats!', '2004-04-05 01:27:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(653631, 66889, 15207, '<td valign="top">I thought for sure you''d get  a ribbon! But congrats on the high placement anyway. It is a beautiful shot!</td>', 'I thought for sure you''d get  a ribbon! But congrats on the high placement anyway. It is a beautiful shot!', '2004-04-05 01:28:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(653638, 66970, 14386, '<td valign="top">Ken...congratulations! So you are very happy with your D70, huh? Very very beautiful picture here. Like it a lot.</td>', 'Ken...congratulations! So you are very happy with your D70, huh? Very very beautiful picture here. Like it a lot.', '2004-04-05 01:34:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(653649, 66927, 12962, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the top ten finish.  This one grabbed me because of the colors.</td>', 'Congratulations on the top ten finish.  This one grabbed me because of the colors.', '2004-04-05 01:40:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(653652, 67051, 12962, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the top ten finish!  Full of humor and endearment.</td>', 'Congratulations on the top ten finish!  Full of humor and endearment.', '2004-04-05 01:41:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(653658, 67047, 16499, '<td valign="top">Come on, I put this one at the first place in my voting and alas... <br/>My opinion is as such:<br/>1. The background is irrelevant - the expression on the face cost a milion!<br/>2. Motion blur + DOF but I still see the motion!<br/>3. I don''t need to see even a bit more in the frame - I am perfectly aware that she is riding a bike, I would even dare to guess the phase of the pedals at this moment as well as the height difference between the seat and handles! (not that I am a pro biker, just some experience)<br/> <br/>Scrum, do not get disappointed, you are the best no matter what! (and definitely better than me in the same challenge ;-)))</td>', 'Come on, I put this one at the first place in my voting and alas... My opinion is as such:1. The background is irrelevant - the expression on the face cost a milion!2. Motion blur + DOF but I still see the motion!3. I don''t need to see even a bit more in the frame - I am perfectly aware that she is riding a bike, I would even dare to guess the phase of the pedals at this moment as well as the height difference between the seat and handles! (not that I am a pro biker, just some experience) Scrum, do not get disappointed, you are the best no matter what! (and definitely better than me in the same challenge ;-)))', '2004-04-05 01:45:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(653666, 66984, 10167, '<td valign="top">Woo hoo!  Finally a ribbon!  Thanks everyone for your votes and comments...  Much appreciated!!<br/>Jason</td>', 'Woo hoo!  Finally a ribbon!  Thanks everyone for your votes and comments...  Much appreciated!!Jason', '2004-04-05 01:57:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(653676, 67023, 6388, '<td valign="top">So very very cool.  I''d have given this an 8 if i voted.  sorry :)<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'So very very cool.  I''d have given this an 8 if i voted.  sorry :) Pedro', '2004-04-05 02:07:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(653678, 66425, 669, '<td valign="top">Close one, G.  I really like this shot.  Excellent technique too.</td>', 'Close one, G.  I really like this shot.  Excellent technique too.', '2004-04-05 02:12:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(653679, 66425, 9932, '<td valign="top">Congrats! So close.<br/>How many Brewskies did you have before LOL<br/>Nice work!</td>', 'Congrats! So close.How many Brewskies did you have before LOLNice work!', '2004-04-05 02:13:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(653680, 67003, 9932, '<td valign="top">James very nice work!<br/>Should have been in the top 3 :)</td>', 'James very nice work!Should have been in the top 3 :)', '2004-04-05 02:14:10.000000', NULL, 0),
