(653686, 67161, 9932, '<td valign="top">This shot was an accident :)<br/>I was practicing the panning technic and the second biker ran past.<br/>So I entered it just for the heck of it.<br/>I knew the first biker was not clear enough for a real good score.</td>', 'This shot was an accident :)I was practicing the panning technic and the second biker ran past.So I entered it just for the heck of it.I knew the first biker was not clear enough for a real good score.', '2004-04-05 02:18:32.000000', NULL, 0),
