(654353, 67016, 8139, '<td valign="top">First, thanks everyone for your encouraging comments, this second ribbon in one month of time is a good result of what is so important at DPC: emulation.<br/>About the shot: as Gary said, Belgium is the homeland of bike racing, and Spring classics are running every W-E now. This one made six rounds circuits around my village, so i had the time to take up to 150 photos, with only the motion blur challenge in head. And at the selection I retain this "classic" motion blur, technically near perfection, but lacking a bit creativity. O well, i''m happy today.</td>', 'First, thanks everyone for your encouraging comments, this second ribbon in one month of time is a good result of what is so important at DPC: emulation.About the shot: as Gary said, Belgium is the homeland of bike racing, and Spring classics are running every W-E now. This one made six rounds circuits around my village, so i had the time to take up to 150 photos, with only the motion blur challenge in head. And at the selection I retain this "classic" motion blur, technically near perfection, but lacking a bit creativity. O well, i''m happy today.', '2004-04-05 13:46:35.000000', NULL, 0),
